<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOS" style="id">- Selee Old Testament</book>
  <para style="h">YOSUA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yosua</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yosua</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yos</para>
  <para style="mt1">YOSUA</para>
  <para style="mt2">KUKŨ</para>
  <para style="imt">ODIKI OTUO</para>
  <para style="im">
    <char style="bk">Yosua Kukũ </char> nle ɔlaa di mmle di Israel batii lafũ ni Kanaan batii kasɔ di Yosua wɔ niale ni Mose asaa laleko ma ni katũ. Sɛsaabla finle se bɛɛkpana ni di kukũ ko mmle kamɛ sewo ninle, Yordan okle ɔwaalɛ, Yeriko kasɔ ɔpɛ, kakpɛ di Ai ku kanya ninii lese lɛbla fɔle di Yaa ku batii nɔɔ ntɛɛ. Yaa ɔlaa onwii bɛɛtɛ- baye ni nwaa di sɛlaa nwu di kukũ nwu kamɛ ninle alɛ, “Kafɔɔ nse SAATE nwu osumu kamakpɛ ye nkyɔkɔ yi, ni miɛ dii le mmle bidiki nnwɔ bibasumu ni bita suoto lee, nse afiɔ ya di bawa lee lasumu ni di Okle kamaa, ee Amori batii ba kasɔ bisi ni afiɔ. Kafɔɔ ami ku leyo nii batii, bubasumu SAATE nwu.” (24:15)</para>
  <para style="iot">Kukũ Nwu Kamɛ Sɛlaa</para>
  <para style="io1">Lelenkee di Kanaan suoto 1. 1-12.24</para>
  <para style="io1">Kasɔ nwu ɔsɛ 13.1-21.45</para>
  <para style="io2">a. Kasɔ nwu di Yordan kufĩ katunkɔ 13.1-33</para>
  <para style="io2">b. Kasɔ nwu di Yordan kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ 14.1-19.51</para>
  <para style="io2">c. Katanikokɔ sekpoo kplɛ nwu 20.1-9</para>
  <para style="io2">d. Lewi batii sekpoo kplɛ nwu 21.1-45</para>
  <para style="io1">Kufĩ katunkɔ ana nwu lakple baasifi kasɔ lɛma 22.1-34</para>
  <para style="io1">Yosua ɔklaa lɛkakatɛ 23.1-16</para>
  <para style="io1">Kanya ninii lese lɛbla fɔle nwu di Sekem 24.1-33</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOS 1" />
  <para style="s1">Yaa Ladiki Kanya Alɛ Yosua Alaafũ Kanaan Kasɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 1:1" />Di SAATE nwu kpɛmblatɛ Mose kukpi sɛmaa, SAATE nwu latɔkɔ Nun obisuɔtɔbi Yosua, Mose kyakaakotɛ alɛ: <verse eid="JOS 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 1:2" />“Kpɛmblatɛ nii Mose ntookpi. Nioso nunua, afɔ ku batii ba mmle bamuu, bilolaa suoto biɛlaawaalɛ Yordan Okle nwu bisifi kasɔ ka komiɛ nlɛ kɔyɔ nta ma ni- nta Israel batii. <verse eid="JOS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 1:3" />Kamayɔ kakɔ biala biese kɔkpaa lee nta ye, fɛ mmle latɔkɔ ni Mose latɛ nii. <verse eid="JOS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 1:4" />Kasɔ lee nwu kamadie di ɔfaafuu nwu kanaadu Lebanon, kandie kafɔɔ di Eufrate okle kplɛ nwu- Hiti batii kale kamuu- kanaadu Lekpo Kplɛ nwu di kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ. <verse eid="JOS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 1:5" />Kuonwii dilɔbafuo ɔtaka oyila di suoto lɛfɔ di ayi lɛfɔ amuu kamɛ. Fɛ mmle lasiɛko ni Mose, nkpo kamasiɛko fɔ nɛ; namadiɛ fɔ diidii ee nsĩ fɔ.<verse eid="JOS 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 1:6" />“Wɛ osie, faawɛ sɛkambi, diekye afɔ nimaleko batii ba mmle katũ manaale kasɔ nwu atesaa ya laka ntam lata ni bawa lɛma nlɛ kamata ma ni nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 1:7" />Wɛ osie, faatɛ fawɛ sɛkambi kafɔɔ. Lolaa fanyu falɛ feele kufiofa ko kumuu di kpɛmblatɛ nii Mose lata fɔ ni; tankyi ninkũ suoto faafe koletanɛɛ ee kɔmɛntu, alɛ asaa kalɛ fɔ ɔkyɛ di kakɔ lele feekyɛ. <verse eid="JOS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 1:8" />Tanta Kufiofa Kukũ ko mmle sɛlaa layɛ di kanya lɛfɔ; bu kũ disi kakũ ku kakyɛ, di mmle fabalolaa fannyu, fambla ni lɛsaa biala bɛɛkpana ni ninkũ kamɛ. Ni dibalɛ fɔ, asaa kafɔɔ nlɛ fɔ ɔkyɛ. <verse eid="JOS 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 1:9" />Ntatɔkɔ fɔ kanya nlɛ, wɛ osie? faawɛ sɛkambi. Tanta difu lapɛ fɔ; tanta nnɛɛ lafee fɔ, diekye SAATE, Yaa lɛfɔ kamasiɛko fɔ kakɔ lele fɛɛkyɛ.”<verse eid="JOS 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yosua Latɔkɔ Batii Nwu Nle Dikaatɛ Bɛɛbla Ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 1:10" />Nioso Yosua latɔkɔ batii nwu banɔɔfotii alɛ: <verse eid="JOS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 1:11" />“Bifenfe di kasiɛkɔ nwu kamɛ biɛtɔkɔ batii nwu bilɛ, ‘Bisiisa alesaa lee bitɛ. Diebu ayi atiɛ bibawaalɛ Yordan Okle ninfũ minsifi minaayɔ kasɔ ka di SAATE, Yaa lee kɔyɔ anta ye kambla ye ni kale.’”<verse eid="JOS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 1:12" />Kafɔɔ Yosua latɔkɔ Ruben batii ku Gad batii ku Manase kɔna-kakyɛ nwu alɛ, <verse eid="JOS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 1:13" />“Binyuma ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kpɛmblatɛ Mose latɔkɔ ye ni alɛ: ‘SAATE, Yaa lee nwu kɔta ye ɔnyɛɛ ɔtɛ, ni atɔɔta ye kasɔ ka mmle nɛ.’  <verse eid="JOS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 1:14" />Basɔfɔ lee ku babi lee ku babɔkɛɛ sele lee kasiɛ di kasɔ ka di Mose lata ye ni di Yordan kufĩ katunkɔ, kafɔɔ bakpɛtɛ-suɔtɔ lee bamuu ninkle ni akpɛsaa amuu bawaalɛ bale babilee-suɔtɔ katũ. Dikpeni biɛkyakaako babilee-suɔtɔ <verse eid="JOS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 1:15" />diɛlaase di obe wɔ di SAATE nwu mata ma ni ɔnyɛɛ ɔtɛ, fɛ mmle atɔɔbla ɛɛta ye nii, dilaase di obe wɔ di mma kafɔɔ batoofũ ni kasɔ ka di SAATE, Yaa lee kɔta ma ni. Nni sɛmaa, biakple minsifi minaasiɛ di kasɔ lee kamu, nka di SAATE nwu kpɛmblatɛ Mose lata ye ni di Yordan kufĩ katunkɔ diofe ni nfũ di kufĩ ntũ nii.”<verse eid="JOS 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 1:16" />Ninfɛ baatɔkɔ Yosua alɛ, “Kanya lele feediki wo bubabla, kakɔ lele kafɔɔ feekpee wo bubakyɛ. <verse eid="JOS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 1:17" />Fɛ mmle buakyɔɔ ni Mose atoko nwaa, nkpo bubakyɔɔ fɔ atoko nɛ. SAATE, Yaa lɛfɔ lete ninsiɛko fɔ, fɛ mmle aasiɛko ni Mose. <verse eid="JOS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 1:18" />Otii lele niɛtaka eeyila di sɛlaa lɛfɔ suoto, anankyɔɔ ɔlaa lɛfɔ atoko, di ɔlaa lele fɛɛtɔkɔ ma yi, babalo nwɔ. Osie ko faawɛ, faawɛ sɛkambi kafɔɔ!”<verse eid="JOS 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOS 2" />
  <para style="s1">Yosua Lakpee Batii Alɛ Balaala Yeriko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 2:1" />Ninfɛ di Nun obisuɔtɔbi Yosua lakpee batii banyɔ baadie ni Sitim di lewofa kamɛ alɛ balaala: aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Bikyɛ, biɛlaanyu kasɔ nwu, kyenkye Yeriko.” Nioso baakyɛ baalaabuo sɔnɔkpeetɛ onwii leyo, leyooto nɔɔ niale Rahab, ni baasiɛ ninfa nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 2:2" />Ni baatɔkɔ Yeriko ɔka alɛ, “Nyu lo! Israel batii bawo ntɔɔwa nfũ kakyɛ ka mmle alɛ bɔɔbala kasɔ nwu.” <verse eid="JOS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 2:3" />Nioso Yeriko ɔka lata Rahab kanya ka mmle alɛ, “Diki basuɔtɔ ba niababuo ni leyo lɛfɔ fawako, diekye bɛɛwa alɛ bɔɔbala kasɔ nwu kamuu.”<verse eid="JOS 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 2:4" />Kafɔɔ ɔsanko nwu layɔ basuɔtɔ nwu banyɔ aawofasa. Ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Nwaako, basuɔtɔ nwu lawa ɔkyɛ nii, kafɔɔ nin-ye ɔfɛ beekye. <verse eid="JOS 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 2:5" />Di kɔtɔɔfɔ, di obe lawo alɛ baasɛɛ ni okpoo nwu kayoko, basuɔtɔ nwu lasifi. Nin-ye ɔmɛnsuku beefe. Bitikanko ma wla. Bibawɛ ma.” <verse eid="JOS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 2:6" />(Kafɔɔ Rahab lakpaa ma aasifiko lɛkya osi aalaawofasa ma di seleteku sɛkpaalɛ se aatɛ ni kalɔ di lɛkya nwu.) <verse eid="JOS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 2:7" />Nioso basuɔtɔ ba di ɔka lakpee ni ladie baati batii ba niakyɛ ni kasɔ nwu ɔla di osuku wɔ niafe ni Yordan kawaalɛkɔ. Obe wɔ di mba niati ni kasɔ nwu balantɛ ladie ni odie, ni baasɛɛ kayoko nwu nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 2:8" />Fiɛ di kasɔ nwu balantɛ kamate ni ku kakyɛ nwu yi, Rahab lakyɛ lɛkya nwu osi <verse eid="JOS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 2:9" />ni aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, “N-ye nlɛ SAATE nwu ntɔɔyɔ kasɔ ka mmle ɛɛta ye, nioso aye lɛyɛkɛ kplɛ nwu ntɔɔpɛ wo, alɛ mba bamuu ninsi ni di kale ka mmle kotũtũkũ ku lɛyɛkɛ ta aye oso. <verse eid="JOS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 2:10" />Butoonu mmle di SAATE nwu lasɔɔsa ni Lekpo Sɛɛle ntu aata ye ni di obe wɔ biadiɛ ni di Egipte, ku nle biabla ni Sihon ku Og, Amori batii baka nwu banyɔ di Yordan kufĩ katunkɔ, nnwɔ faawɔɔsa ni fɛɛ. <verse eid="JOS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 2:11" />Obe wɔ buanu nwu ni ole, situ loo lakpa, nnɛɛ kafɔɔ lafee obiala ta aye oso. Diekye SAATE, Yaa lee nle Yaa di osi kaatoo ku kasɔ kaalɔ. <verse eid="JOS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 2:12" />Nioso nunua, lekoto bika ntam di SAATE nwu suoto bitɛɛ bilɛ bibale leyo nii batii sifutulɛ, diekye ntoole ye sifutulɛ. Bituo mi nwaako dituosaa <verse eid="JOS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 2:13" />alɛ bibafũ teemi ku yaami ku babiloo-suɔtɔbi ku babiloo-sankobi ku mba bamuu ninle ma ni bale nkpa, alɛ biadiki wo minkyeko kukpi kamɛ.”<verse eid="JOS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 2:14" />Basuɔtɔ nwu labuɛ baatika difuɔ baatɔɔ alɛ, “Nkpa loo ninle nkpa lee! Nse faabuɛ lɛsaa le buɔbla nii, ni bubale ye sifutulɛ ku onukwale nse SAATE nwu lɛta wo kasɔ nwu.”<verse eid="JOS 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 2:15" />Nioso Rahab lata ma baafe di sɛfle baasoo di okũ suoto, diekye leyo nɔɔ le aasiɛ ni lale okpoo nwu oyoyiɛ owo. <verse eid="JOS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 2:16" />Aatɔkɔ ma aatɛ alɛ, “Bisifi akpenkpe nwu alɛ mba nikoti ye ni dilɔbanya ye. Biwofasa suoto lee ninfa ayi atiɛ dilaase di obe wɔ beekple ni, fiɛ nfɛ bieyefe osuku lee.”<verse eid="JOS 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 2:17" />Ni di basuɔtɔ nwu latɔkɔ Rahab alɛ, “Ntam be mmle fɛɛta wo buɔka ni dilɔbawa kaanya dita wo, <verse eid="JOS 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 2:18" />diediki, buobuo kasɔ ka faanii ni okpilakpi sɛɛle wɔ mmle di sɛfle wɔ faata wo buafe buasoo nii. Diediki fatɔɔkpaa kafɔɔ teefɔ ku yaafɔ ku babilee-suɔtɔbi ku leyo lɛfɔ batii bamuu fɛɛwako leyo lɛfɔ fiɛ. <verse eid="JOS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 2:19" />Nse otii lele niedie di leyo lɛfɔ eesifi lɛkpaka, ni ntɔ nɔɔ kamatika di nnwɔɔ omu disi; kulɔbale wo ɔlaa. Kafɔɔ otii lele ninkpe di leyo ku afɔ yi, ntɔ nɔɔ kamatika di disi loo nse kɔnɛɛ loo lɛkpanko nwɔ. <verse eid="JOS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 2:20" />Kafɔɔ nse feebuɛ lɛsaa le buɔbla nii, ni bubadie di ntam be faata wo buaka ni kamɛ.”<verse eid="JOS 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 2:21" />Ni di Rahab latuna alɛ, “Lenu, bita kute fɛ mmle biebuɛ ni.” Nioso aadiki ma osuku, ni baasifi nɛ. Ni aanii okpilakpi sɛɛle di sɛfle nwu nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 2:22" />Obe wɔ baasifi nii, baalaasiɛ di akpenkpe nwu ninfa ayi atiɛ, dialaase di obe wɔ di mba nikoti ma ni lawolaa osuku omuu baafenko batanya ma ni, baakple baasifi nii. <verse eid="JOS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 2:23" />Ninfɛ di basuɔtɔ nwu banyɔ lakple baatoosifi nɛ. Baasoo baakye akpenkpe nwu, baawaalɛ okle baawa Nun obisuɔtɔbi Yosua nfũ baabatɔkɔ nwɔ lɛsaa biala niawa ni di suoto lɛma. <verse eid="JOS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 2:24" />Baatɔkɔ Yosua alɛ, “Nwaako SAATE nwu ntɔɔyɔ kasɔ nwu kamuu eekpee wo ninnɛɛ; batii nwu bamuu kotũtũkũ ku lɛyɛkɛ ta awo oso.”<verse eid="JOS 2:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOS 3" />
  <para style="s1">Israel Batii Lawaalɛ Yordan Okle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 3:1" />Di kolesɛtũ Yosua ku Israel batii bamuu ladie di Sitim baasifi Yordan, nfũ baasiɛ ni fiɛ baawaalɛ nii. <verse eid="JOS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 3:2" />Di ayi atiɛ sɛmaa banɔɔfotii nwu lafenfe di kasiɛkɔ nwu kamɛ, <verse eid="JOS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 3:3" />baatɔɔta batii nwu letofo alɛ: “Nse biɛnya SAATE Yaa lee nwu kanya niniii lɛlakaa, ku olebatatɛ ba ninle ni Lewi batii ntuka ni yi, ni, ayee biedie di nsiɛkɔ lee bitikanko ni. <verse eid="JOS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 3:4" />Ni bibatofo osuku wɔ biafe nii, diekye biikyɛ di osuku wɔ mmle binya diidii. Kafɔɔ bita obo fɛ nnɛɛ ditika kakpe disiɛ di aye ku lɛlakaa nwu ntɛɛ; batantɛɛtɛɛ ni.”<verse eid="JOS 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 3:5" />Yosua latɔkɔ batii nwu alɛ, “Bikleklesa suoto lee, diekye kɔsɛɛ SAATE nwu kamabla asaa ya niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ di kamɛ lee.”<verse eid="JOS 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 3:6" />Ninfɛ di Yosua latɔkɔ olebatatɛ nwu alɛ, “Biyɔ kanya ninii lɛlakaa nwu biefe bile batii nwu katũ.” Nioso baakɛnkɛ ni, ni baafe baale ma katũ nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 3:7" />Ni di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ Yosua alɛ, “Miɛ kamakye kasɔ ntɔɔtakatɛsa fɔ katoo di Israel batii bamuu anu, mmle baatofo alɛ nsiko fɔ ni, fɛ mmle lasiɛko ni Mose. <verse eid="JOS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 3:8" />Tɔkɔ olebatatɛ ba nintuka ni kanya ninii lɛlakaa nwu falɛ: ‘Nse biedu Yordan ntu kotoko yi, biɛkyɛ bilaayila di okle nwu kamɛ.’”<verse eid="JOS 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 3:9" />Ni di Yosua latɔkɔ Israel batii nwu alɛ, “Biwa ninfũ biɛbanu SAATE Yaa lee nwu sɛlaa. <verse eid="JOS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 3:10" />Nnya nle mmle bibayɔ mintofo bilɛ Yaa wɔ ninkpe ni nkpa nsi ye ni kaamɛ, alɛ nwaako abatososa ni Kanaan batii, Hiti batii, Hiwi batii, Peris batii, Girgasi batii, Amori batii ku Yebusi batii andiki ni di anu lee. <verse eid="JOS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 3:11" />Binyu, kasɔ kamuu SAATE nwu kanya ninii lɛlakaa nwu kamale ye katũ ninfe di Yordan okle kamɛ. <verse eid="JOS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 3:12" />Nioso nunua, diki basuɔtɔ lefosi-banyɔ fakyeko Israel ana nwu kamɛ, onwii akye kɔna biala kamɛ. <verse eid="JOS 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 3:13" />Nfanwu, nfanwu di olebatatɛ ba nintuka ni SAATE nwu lɛlakaa- kasɔ kamuu SAATE nwu- lekpee kɔkpaa di Yordan okle yi, ntu nɔɔ be nikobiɛ ninfe ni kala kamabudi, nintaka ninyila fɛ ditii.”<verse eid="JOS 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 3:14" />Nioso obe wɔ di batii nwu ladie ni di kasiɛkɔ lɛma alɛ bɔɔlaawaalɛ ni Yordan okle, olebatatɛ ba nintuka ni kanya ninii lɛlakaa nwu lafe baale ma katũ. <verse eid="JOS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 3:15" />Obe nwu kamɛ Yordan ntooyii di ofiɛlɛbee kamɛ. Kafɔɔ nfanwu, nfanwu di olebatatɛ ba niatuka ni lɛlakaa nwu ladu ni Yordan okle di nkpaa lɛma lakpanko ni ntu nwu kotoko, <verse eid="JOS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 3:16" />ntu be nikobiɛ ninkye ni katoo ladiɛ ofe. Ntu lapɛ lɛboo diabla ditii obo kplɛ late fanfa, di okpoo onwii bɔɔlɛɛ ni Adam di Saretan ɔlɔɔkɔ. Obe wɔ di ntu be nikobiɛ ninfe ni kala nimbuo ni di Araba Lekpo (Mmba Lekpo) latɛ diabudi. Nioso batii nwu lawaalɛ baasifi Yeriko kakyɛ nyɔɔfa. <verse eid="JOS 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 3:17" />Olebatatɛ ba niatuka ni SAATE nwu kanya ninii lɛlakaa layila kpinkpĩ di kasɔ kosole suoto di Yordan ntɛɛntɛɛ, ni di Israel batii bamuu lafe dialaase di obe wɔ di kale nwu kamuu laloo ni ɔwaalɛ fɛɛ di kasɔ kosole nwu suoto.<verse eid="JOS 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOS 4" />
  <para style="s1">Baase Onyuma Afuɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 4:1" />Obe wɔ di kale nwu kamuu laloo ni Yordan okle ɔwaalɛ, SAATE nwu latɔkɔ Yosua alɛ, <verse eid="JOS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 4:2" />“Diki basuɔtɔ lefosi-banyɔ fakyeko batii nwu kamɛ, kɔna biala onwii. <verse eid="JOS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 4:3" />Tɔkɔ ma kafɔɔ falɛ bayɔ lefosi afuɔ anyɔ di Yordan okle ntɛɛntɛɛ di lɛba le tintĩ di olebatatɛ nwu layila ni, baatuka nya basifiko balaatɛ di lɛba le bibate ni ku kakyɛ nwu.”<verse eid="JOS 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 4:4" />Nioso Yosua lalɛɛ basuɔtɔ lefosi-banyɔ nwu aadiki ni di Israel batii kamɛ asiisa, kɔna biala onwii. <verse eid="JOS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 4:5" />Ni aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Bife bile SAATE Yaa lee nwu lɛlakaa katũ bisifi Yordan okle ntɛɛntɛɛ. Obiala lee akɛnkɛ difuɔ atika di nimuusi nɔɔ, di ana lee di Israel batii lɛpɔ kanya, <verse eid="JOS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 4:6" />diatuo ni fɛ dituosaa di kamɛ lee. Di dii kaamaa, nse babi lee lɛkaalɛ ye alɛ, ‘Afuɔ ya mmle kasɔ mɔ?’ <verse eid="JOS 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 4:7" />Bitɔkɔ ma bilɛ baabudi Yordan okle kuadiɛ obiɛ ofe di SAATE nwu kanya ninii lɛlakaa anu. Obe wɔ di lɛlakaa nwu lawaalɛ ni Yordan okle, ntu nwu di Yordan labudi. Afuɔ ya mmle nle ninyumasaa diɛta Israel batii dinaa ni kaloo.”<verse eid="JOS 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 4:8" />Nioso Israel batii labla fɛ mmle di Yosua latɔkɔ ma nii. Baayɔ lefosi afuɔ anyɔ di Yordan okle ntɛɛntɛɛ, di Israel batii ana lɛpɔ kanya, fɛ mmle di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ ni Yosua; ni baatuka nya baalaadu kasiɛkɔ lɛma, nfa baayɔ nya baatɛ nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 4:9" />Ni di Yosua latɛ lefosi afuɔ anyɔ nwu niate ni di Yordan okle ntɛɛntɛɛ di lɛba le tintĩ di olebatatɛ ba niatuka ni kanya ninii lɛlakaa nwu layila nii. Nioso ate ninfa diɛbadu miɛ dii le mmle.<verse eid="JOS 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 4:10" />Olebatatɛ ba niatuka ni lɛlakaa nwu labe baayila di Yordan okle ntɛɛntɛɛ dialase di obe wɔ di batii nwu labla ni lɛsaa biala le di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ ni Yosua, fɛ mmle di Mose latɔkɔ ni Yosua. Batii nwu lapɛsɛwa baafe. <verse eid="JOS 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 4:11" />Di bamuu lɛma lawaalɛ, ɔwaalɛ, ni di olebatatɛ nwu ku SAATE nwu lɛlakaa ladie baawa kakyɛka nyɔɔfa, di batii latoonyu nii. <verse eid="JOS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 4:12" />Ruben ku Gad ku Manase kɔna-kakyɛ kanwii basuɔtɔ lawaalɛ baafe ku akpɛsaa baale Israel batii katũ, fɛ mmle di Mose latɔkɔ ma nii. <verse eid="JOS 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 4:13" />Basuɔtɔ fɛ nkpe afosi-ana ba niaklee ni akpɛsaa baata ni kakpɛ lawaalɛ baafe di SAATE nwu anu baakyɛ kakpɛ di Yeriko sɛtaata.<verse eid="JOS 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 4:14" />Dii nwu nkpo SAATE nwu latakatɛsa Yosua katoo di Israel batii bamuu anu; ni baayɔ dibu baatɔɔ di nkpa nɔɔ ayi amuu kamɛ nɛ, fɛ mmle baabu ni Mose.<verse eid="JOS 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 4:15" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ Yosua alɛ, <verse eid="JOS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 4:16" />“Tɔkɔ olebatatɛ ba nintuka ni Kanya Ninii Lɛlakaa nwu baadie di Yordan okle nwu kamɛ.”<verse eid="JOS 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 4:17" />Nioso Yosua latɔkɔ olebatatɛ nwu alɛ, “Bidie di Yordan okle nwu kamɛ.”<verse eid="JOS 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 4:18" />Ni di olebatatɛ nwu nintuka ni SAATE nwu kanya ninii lɛlakaa ladie di okle nwu kamɛ nɛ. Baase ose nkpaa lɛma di kasɔ kosole suoto yi, ni di Yordan okle ntu lakple diasifi lɛba nimi, diayii fɛ mmle diate ni saa.<verse eid="JOS 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 4:19" />Di dii fosile di kɔwɛntɛ kasale, di Israel awɛntɛ kanya, batii nwu lakata baadie di Yordan okle baalaasiɛ di Gilgal di Yeriko kufĩ katunkɔ kɔmɛ. <verse eid="JOS 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 4:20" />Ninfɛ di Yosua lase lefosi afuɔ anyɔ nwu baayɔ ni di Yordan okle di Gilgal nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 4:21" />Ni aatɔkɔ Israel batii alɛ, “Dii kaamaa nse banantii lee lɛkaalɛ bate lɛma alɛ, ‘Afuɔ ya mmle kasɔ mɔ?’ <verse eid="JOS 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 4:22" />Bitɔkɔ ma bilɛ, ‘Israel batii lawaalɛ Yordan okle di kasɔ kosole suoto.’  <verse eid="JOS 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 4:23" />Diekye SAATE Yaa lee lasɔɔsa Yordan okle di anu lee dialaase di obe wɔ biawaalɛ baafe ni. SAATE Yaa lee nwu labla di Yordan fɛ mmle aabla ni di Lekpo Sɛɛle di obe wɔ aasɔɔsa nini di anu loo dialaase di obe wɔ buawaalɛ buafe nii. <verse eid="JOS 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 4:24" />Aabla nle mmle alɛ batii bamuu kaasɔ suoto katofo alɛ SAATE nwu kɔnɛɛ nkpe osie alɛ obe lele biayɛkɛ SAATE Yaa lee nwu.”<verse eid="JOS 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOS 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 5:1" />Obe wɔ di Amori batii baka bamuu di Yordan kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ ku Kanaan baka bamuu di lekpo kotoko lanu ni mmle di SAATE nwu lata Yordan okle lasɔɔ ni di Israel batii nwu anu, dialaase ni di obe wɔ baawaalɛ baafe nii, situ lɛma lapɛ, nioso batasinwɛ sɛkambi alɛ baakyɔɔ Israel batii anu.<verse eid="JOS 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Suoto Ɔkyɛlɛnsa Di Gilgal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 5:2" />Di obe nwu kamɛ, SAATE nwu latɔkɔ Yosua alɛ, “Bla afuɔ mpamii faakple fakyɛlɛnsa Israel batii ba suoto manadikyɛlɛnsa ni.” <verse eid="JOS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 5:3" />Nioso Yosua labla afuɔ mpamii aakyɛlɛnsa Israel basuɔtɔ suoto di Gibeat Aralot.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gibeat Aralot lɛsɔdiki ninle alɛ, sisuɔtɔ osi kopoo</char></note><verse eid="JOS 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 5:4" />Nnya lɛsaa le oso aabla ni nkpo: Mba bamuu niadie ni di Egipte-basuɔtɔ ba bamuu niawo ni bakpɛtɛ alɛɛ kanya-lakpi di ɔfaafuu nwu di osuku obe wɔ baadie ni di Egipte. <verse eid="JOS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 5:5" />Baakyɛlɛnsa basuɔtɔ ba bamuu niadie ni ninfa suoto, kafɔɔ basuɔtɔ ba bamuu baalofo ni di ɔfaafuu di osuku ɔkyɛ lɛma kamɛ, baadie ni di Egipte batakyɛlɛnsa ma suoto. <verse eid="JOS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 5:6" />Diekye Israel batii lakyɛ baakyi di ɔfaafuu nwu alɛɛ afosi-ana dialaase di obe wɔ di basuɔtɔ ba bamuu niawo ni kakpɛ ɔkyɛ di obe wɔ baadie ni di Egipte kasɔ lakpi. Ta batakyɔɔ ni SAATE ɔlaa atoko oso. Diekye SAATE nwu laka ntam aata ma alɛ blɔbanya kasɔ ka aatɛ aabuɛ aatɛ ni bate lɛma alɛ abata wo nii. Kasɔ ka di nnyɛɛtu ku bablɔ kobiɛ ninfe nii. <verse eid="JOS 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 5:7" />Nioso aanyu babisuɔtɔbi lɛma asi baabayila di kayilakɔ lɛma, mma nfɛ niale mba suoto di Yosua lakyɛlɛnsa ni nɛ. Batakyɛlɛnsa ma suoto di obe nwu, diekye badikyɛlɛnsa ma suoto di osuku. <verse eid="JOS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 5:8" />Baakyɛlɛnsa ni kale nwu kamuu basuɔtɔ suoto baaloo ni kamaa, baasiɛ di kasiɛkɔ nwu dialaase di obe wɔ di suoto lasie ma nii.<verse eid="JOS 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 5:9" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ Yosua alɛ, “Miɛ ntootekete sɛlanle ole di Egipte di suoto lee.” Nioso bɔɔlɛɛ lɛba nwu alɛ Gilgal diɛbadu miɛ.<verse eid="JOS 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 5:10" />Di kɔwɛntɛ nwu lefosi dii naafa kɔtɔɔfɔ, di Israel batii awɛntɛ kanya, obe wɔ baasiɛ ni di Gilgal di Yeriko sɛtaata nwu yi, Israel batii lale Okpi Diisi Ofe dii. <verse eid="JOS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 5:11" />Di Okpi Diisi Ofe dii nwu kaleesɛ, dii nwu nkpo kale, baale kasɔ nwu suoto alesaa: bloblo wɔ manankpee ni lɛnyankasaa ku atitabi sɛnle. <verse eid="JOS 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 5:12" />Mana ladiɛ ɔkpakpaa di dii le baale ni kasɔ nwu alesaa kaleesɛ; mana kuonwii ditasinwɛ aata Israel batii. Kafɔɔ lɛlɛɛ nwu nkpo baale Kanaan kasɔ alesaa.<verse eid="JOS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yosua Ku Osuɔtɔ Wɔ Ninkle Ni Kapamii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 5:13" />Obe wɔ di Yosua latɛɛtɛɛ ni Yeriko, aatakatɛsa anu aanyu katoo, ni aanya osuɔtɔ onwii n-yɛ nwɔ di anu ku kapamii ɛɛbɔkɔtɛ akle ni di kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ nɛ. Ni di Yosua lakata aakyɛ nwɔ katũ aalaakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Ole wo fale ɛɛ, sɛɛ balo loo ole?”<verse eid="JOS 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 5:14" />Ninfɛ di osuɔtɔ nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Ninle kuonwii ole, kafɔɔ fɛ SAATE nwu bakpɛtɛ kanyayilatɛ, mianwu lɛwa nɛ.” Ninfɛ di Yosua lase katũ kaasɔ di dibu kanya, ni aakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Ɔmɛnlaa ninkpe saate nii ɛɛta kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ?”<verse eid="JOS 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 5:15" />Ni di SAATE nwu kakpɛ kanyayilatɛ nwɔ labuɛ alɛ, “Diki ntokota lɛfɔ, diekye lɛba le fayɛ ni lɛbla klekle.” Ninfɛ di Yosua labla nkpo nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 5:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOS 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yeriko Kalookɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 6:1" />Obe nwu baasɛɛ Yeriko n-yoko kpinkpĩ ta Israel batii oso. Kuonwii ditadie aafe kayi, kuonwii kafɔɔ ditabuo kaamɛ.<verse eid="JOS 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 6:2" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ Yosua alɛ, “Nyu, ntɔɔyɔ Yeriko, baka nɔɔ ku basuɔtɔ bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ lekpee di nnɛɛ lɛfɔ. <verse eid="JOS 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 6:3" />Bikyɛ bikyi okpoo nwu ninwii ku basuɔtɔ bakpɛtɛ bamuu. Bibla nkpo ayi akuɔ. <verse eid="JOS 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 6:4" />Ta olebatatɛ bakuɛnsĩ baklee akunumuu akya akyukyoo, di kanya ninii lɛlakaa nwu sitũ. Di dii kuɛnsinle suoto, bikyi okpoo nwu sikuɛnsĩ, di olebatatɛ nwu batɔɔfɛ akyukyoo nwu. <verse eid="JOS 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 6:5" />Nse bienu ma bɛɛfɛ dikyukyoo diɛklɛ yi, faata batii nwu bamuu bafaa osie kanya; nse okpoo nwu oyoyiɛ ntoobiɛ, di Israel batii bakata babuo, osuɔtɔ biala abuo nwu kamɛ.”<verse eid="JOS 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 6:6" />Nioso Nun obisuɔtɔbi Yosua lalɛɛ olebatatɛ nwu aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Bikɛnkɛ SAATE nwu kanya ninii lɛlakaa nwu di olebatatɛ bakuɛnsĩ baklee akyukyoo nwu di lɛlakaa nwu sitũ.” <verse eid="JOS 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 6:7" />Ni aatɔkɔ batii nwu alɛ, “Bikyɛ sitũ! Bikyɛ bikyi okpoo nwu, di akpɛsaa bakleetɛ bale SAATE nwu lɛlakaa katũ.”<verse eid="JOS 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 6:8" />Obe wɔ di Yosua lakakatɛ aata ni batii nwu aloo nii, olebatatɛ bakuɛnsĩ ba niaklee ni akyukyoo akuɛnsĩ di SAATE nwu anu lafe sitũ, baatɔɔfɛ akyukyoo lɛma, ni di SAATE nwu kanya ninii lɛlakaa latikanko ma nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 6:9" />Akpɛsaa bakleetɛ lale olebatatɛ ba niatɔɔfɛ ni akyukyoo katũ, ni di sɛmaa, banyuntɛ latikanko lɛlakaa nwu nɛ. Obe nwu nkpo omuu kamɛ akyukyoo nwu kanya latoodie. <verse eid="JOS 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 6:10" />Kafɔɔ Yosua latɔkɔ batii nwu alɛ, “Bitanwi kakpɛ kaku, bitantakatɛsa sɛlɔ lee katoo, bitambuɛ ɔlaa kuonwii dilaase di dii le lɛtɔkɔ ye nlɛ bifaa nii. Ni biɛfaa!” <verse eid="JOS 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 6:11" />Nioso Yosua lata baatuka SAATE nwu lɛlakaa baakyiko okpoo nwu, baakyi nwu ninwii. Ninfɛ di Israel batii nwu lakple baasifi kasiɛkɔ lɛma baalaate ninfa ku kakyɛ nwu nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 6:12" />Ni di Yosua lataka kaleesɛ kuyitatũ ninfɛ di olebatatɛ nwu layɔ SAATE nwu lɛlakaa nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 6:13" />Olebatatɛ bakuɛnsĩ ba niaklee ni akyukyoo akuɛnsĩ nwu lafe sitũ, baakyɛ di SAATE nwu lɛlakaa anu baatɔɔfɛ akyukyoo. Akpɛsaa bakleetɛ lale ma katũ, ni di sɛmaa, banyuntɛ latikanko SAATE nwu lɛlakaa, obe wɔ di akyukyoo nwu kanya latoodie nii. <verse eid="JOS 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 6:14" />Nioso dii nyɔɔfa baakyɛ baakyi okpoo nwu ninwii ni baakple baasifi kasiɛkɔ lɛma nɛ. Baabla nle mmle ayi akuɔ.<verse eid="JOS 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 6:15" />Di dii kuɛsinle, baataka ku kolesɛtũ baakyɛ baakyi okpoo nwu sikuɛnsĩ di osuku nwu okle kanya, kafɔɔ di dii nwu lete baakyi okpoo nwu sikuɛnsĩ. <verse eid="JOS 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 6:16" />Di dikyi kuɛnsinle nwu, obe wɔ di olebatatɛ lafɛ ni dikyukyoo nwu, ni di Yosua latɔkɔ batii nwu alɛ, “Biyiisaa kudu! Diekye SAATE nwu ntɔɔyɔ okpoo nwu ɛɛta ye! <verse eid="JOS 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 6:17" />Biyɔ okpoo nwu ku asaa ya amuu ninsi nwu ni kaamɛ bibla n-ya bɛɛta ni SAATE nwu. Diediki Rahab, sɔnɔkpeetɛ nwu ku batii ba bamuu ninkpe ni di leyo nɔɔ ku nnwɔɔ lete babafũ nkpa, diekye aawofasa batii ba buakpee baabala kasɔ nwu. <verse eid="JOS 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 6:18" />Kafɔɔ biblasa suoto di asaa ya bɛɛyɔ bɛɛta ni SAATE nwu suoto, di mmle minamayɔ kawɔɔ biwako ni suoto lee di lɛsaa nwu lewo ɔyɔ suoto. Nse diele nkpo bibata kawɔɔ nwa di Israel kasiɛkɔ nwu, ninwako ɔlaa ninnwu suoto. <verse eid="JOS 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 6:19" />Koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle kumuu ku kɔbri asaa ku abɔɔsaa nle asaa klekle ɛɛta SAATE nwu, nioso dikpeni eesifi lɛsaawɛ nɔɔ katɛkɔ.”<verse eid="JOS 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 6:20" />Obe wɔ di akyukyoo kanya ladie ni, batii nwu layiisa kudu, di dikyukyoo kanya didiki ku batii nwu kudu diyiisa osie kanya yi, oyoyiɛ nwu labiɛ; nioso osuɔtɔ biala labuo nwu kamɛ, ni baafũ okpoo nwu nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 6:21" />Ni baayɔ okpoo nwu baakpee di SAATE nwu nnɛɛ nɛ. Ni baawɔɔsa lɛsaa biala ninkpe ni nkpa ku kapamii di kamɛ ninwu nɛ- basuɔtɔ ku basanko, babisɔ ku banɔɔfo, banankyue ku bafoso ku babɔkɛɛ ba nintuka ni atoo.<verse eid="JOS 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 6:22" />Ni di Yosua latɔkɔ basuɔtɔ banyɔ ba niakyɛ baalaala ni kasɔ nwu alɛ, “Bitɔɔkyɛ sɔnɔkpeetɛ nwu leyo biɛlaadiki nnwɔɔ ku mba bamuu ninle nwɔ ni bale, di ntam lee ku nnwɔɔ kanya.” <verse eid="JOS 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 6:23" />Nioso bakosopo ba nialaala ni kasɔ nwɔ lakyɛ baalaadiki Rahab ku ote ku ɔya ku babilɛma-suɔtɔbi ku mba bamuu niale nwɔ ni bale. Baalaadiki leyo nɔɔ batii bamuu, ni baayɔ ma baalaatɛ di Israel batii kasiɛkɔ sɛmaa nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 6:24" />Ninfɛ baafiɛ okpoo kplɛ nwu omuu ku lɛsaa biala ninnwu kamɛ nɛ, kafɔɔ baayɔ koto fututu, koto sɛɛle, kɔbri asaa ku abɔɔsaa baatɛ di SAATE nwu lɛsaawɛ katɛkɔ leyo. <verse eid="JOS 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 6:25" />Kafɔɔ Yosua lafũ Rahab, sɔnɔkpeetɛ nwu ku leyo nɔɔ batii ku mba bamuu niale nwɔ bale nkpa, diekye aawofasa basuɔtɔ ba di Yosua lakpee baalaala ni Yeriko- nioso asi di Israel batii kamɛ diɛbadu obe wɔ baakpana ni sɛlaa se mmle.<verse eid="JOS 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 6:26" />Di obe nwu kamɛ, Yosua laka ntam siene be mmle alɛ: “Otii wɔ nimakple antaka alɛ oose ni Yeriko okpoo wɔ mmle dibudi, bɛɛkpaani nwɔ di SAATE nwu anu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOS 6:26">“Olele nimase nwu lɛsɔse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOS 6:26">dibite nɔɔ kamakpi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOS 6:26">abaloo ni n-yoko ninwu ose yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOS 6:26">obi bisɔnle nɔɔ kamakpi.”<verse eid="JOS 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 6:27" />Nioso SAATE nwu lasiɛko Yosua, ni di leyooto nɔɔ lakyaka kasɔ nwu kamuu nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 6:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOS 7" />
  <para style="s1">Akan Sikpile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 7:1" />Kafɔɔ Israel batii ditale onukwale di asaa ya baayɔ baata ni SAATE nwu suoto; Karmi obisuɔtɔbi Akan layɔ asaa nwu awo, ɔwa nɔɔ niale Sabdi, ɔwatɛtɛ nɔɔ kafɔɔ niale Serah wɔ niakye ni Yuda kɔna kamɛ nɛ. Nioso ɔblɔ lafiɛ SAATE nwu di Israel batii suoto.<verse eid="JOS 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 7:2" />Ninfɛ di Yosua lakpee basuɔtɔ bawo niakye ni Yeriko baakyɛ Ai ninkaako ni Bet Awen di Betel kufĩ katunkɔ alɛ, “Bikata bikyɛ biɛlaala kasɔ nwu.” Nioso basuɔtɔ nwu lakata baakyɛ baalaala Ai.<verse eid="JOS 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 7:3" />Basuɔtɔ nwu lakple baawa babatɔkɔ Yosua alɛ, “Diele batii nwu bamuu dikaatɛ bɛɛkata bɛɛkyɛ bɛɛlaadieko Ai. Kpee basuɔtɔ nkpe nnyɔ ee ntiɛ baalaadieko nwu, tankpee batii bamuu kubuɛ, diekye basuɔtɔ basɛɛ lete ninkpe ninfa.” <verse eid="JOS 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 7:4" />Nioso basuɔtɔ nkpe ntiɛ niakata baakyɛ; kafɔɔ Ai basuɔtɔ lalenkee ma, <verse eid="JOS 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 7:5" />Ai basuɔtɔ lalo fɛ afosi-atiɛ-bakuɔ lɛma. Baatikanko Israel batii baakyeko okpoo nwu kasũkunya baalaadu bia afuɔ kabibiɛkɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">afuɔ kabibiɛkɔ ninle Sebarim nɛ</char></note> baalaalo ma di lɛyɔnsa nwu. Ta nle mmle oso batii nwu situ layɛlɛfɛ siabla fɛle ntu.<verse eid="JOS 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 7:6" />Ninfɛ di Yosua labɛbɛɛ akpeele nɔɔ, ni aafuusa anu kaasɔ di SAATE nwu kanya ninii lɛlakaa nwu anu nɛ, aaka ninfa dialaadu kɔtɔɔfɔ. Israel banɔɔfo kafɔɔ labla nkpo, ni baalɛ kɔtɛ baakpete di asi lɛma nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 7:7" />Ni di Yosua labuɛ alɛ, “Ao, SAATE Kplɛ, obe oso fɛɛkpaa batii ba mmle fɛɛwaalɛsa Yordan okle fɛɛbayɔ wo feekpee di Amori batii nnɛɛ falɛ bawɔɔsa wo? Nse fɛ munsiɛ di Yordan okle kakyɛ nyɔɔfa ditabalɛ ninta wo! <verse eid="JOS 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 7:8" />O SAATE, be nfɛ nimbuɛ, nunua wɔ mmle di balo ntoolenkee ni Israel? <verse eid="JOS 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 7:9" />Kanaan batii ku kale bamba batii kamanu ɔlaa wɔ mmle mamamana wo mankyi man-yɛɛsa leyooto loo di kasɔ suoto. Be nfɛ fababla fanta leyooto lɛfɔ kplɛ nwu?”<verse eid="JOS 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 7:10" />SAATE nwu latɔkɔ Yosua alɛ, “Taka fayila! Obe feefuusa anu lɛfɔ kaasɔ fɔɔbla? <verse eid="JOS 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 7:11" />Israel ntɔɔbla okpile; batɔɔlalaasa kanya ninii nii le latɔkɔ ma nlɛ bale nii. Batɔɔyɔ asaa ya bɛɛyɔ bɛɛta ni SAATE nwu awo; batooyu, batɔɔlaa, batɔɔyɔ nya beekpee di asaa lɛma amu kamɛ. <verse eid="JOS 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 7:12" />Nkpo oso di Israel batii dilɔbafuo balo lɛma oyilako nɛ; beemunikĩisa mmaa lɛma beetoso, diekye batɔɔbla ma bɛɛta kawɔɔ. Namasinwɛ di ɔkyɛ lee diediki biɛwɔɔsa lɛsaa le ninle ni lɛwɔɔsale kaamɛ lee.<verse eid="JOS 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 7:13" />“Tɔɔkyɛ falaakleklesa batii nwu suoto. Tɔkɔ ma falɛ, ‘Bikleklesa suoto lee di suoto ololaa ɔta kɔsɛɛ; diekye nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE, Israel Yaa nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Oo Israel, nle bɛɛyɔ bɛɛta ni SAATE nwu nsi kaamɛ lee. Bilɔbafuo balo lee oyilako diediki biediki ni kaamɛ lee.<verse eid="JOS 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 7:14" />“‘Biwa anu nii ku olesɛ, di kɔna, kɔɔna kanya. Kɔna ko di SAATE nwu kamadiki ni kamadie kunwa sitũ di kafaabi, kafaabi kanya; kafaabi ka di SAATE nwu kamadiki ni kamadie kanwa sitũ, di leyo, leyo kanya; leyo le kafɔɔ di SAATE nwu kamadiki ni kamadie kunwa sitũ, di osuɔtɔ onwii, onwii kanya. <verse eid="JOS 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 7:15" />Otii lele beemufũ ku asaa ya bɛɛyɔ bɛɛta ni SAATE nwu yi, baawɔɔsɔɔ ku ɔtɔ manko asaa nɔɔ amuu. Otii nwu lɛlalaasa SAATE nwu kanya ninii, ɛɛbla kafɔɔ ninunsɔsaa di Israel!’ ”<verse eid="JOS 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 7:16" />Di kaleesɛ kolesɛtũ, Yosua lata Israel batii ladie baawa sitũ di ana lɛma kanya, ni baadiki Yuda kɔna nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 7:17" />Yuda nfaabi ladie baawa sitũ, ni aadiki Serah batii nɛ. Ni aata Serah batii leyo kamɛ batii ladie baawa situ, ni aadiki Sabdi nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 7:18" />Ninfɛ di Yosua lata Sabdi leyo kamɛ batii lawa sitũ onwii, onwii, ni aadiki Karmi obisuɔtɔbi Akan, di ɔwa nɔɔ niale ni Sabdi, ɔwatɛtɛ nɔɔ kafɔɔ niale Serah wɔ niakye ni Yuda kɔna kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 7:19" />Ninfɛ di Yosua latɔkɔ Akan alɛ, “Obisuɔtɔbi nii, yɔ dibu fata SAATE, Israel Yaa nwu, faayɔ katansa fatɔɔ. Tɔkɔ mi lɛsaa le fɛɛbla ni; tan-yɔ ni faakookaa mi.”<verse eid="JOS 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 7:20" />Akan latuna alɛ, “Nwaako dile! Lɛbla okpile di SAATE, Israel Yaa nwu suoto. Nnya lɛsaa le lɛbla ni: <verse eid="JOS 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 7:21" />Lanya ni akpeele wua ya nikɔlɛ ni onyu di Babel batii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Babel ninle Sinar kasɔ nɛ</char></note> lɛsaawɛ nwu kamɛ, ku koto fututu onutũ alafa-anyɔ ku koto sɛɛle aboo onutũ afosi-anɔɔ, aasɛɛ mi anu, ni layɔ nya nɛ. Lekookaa nya kaasɔ di lɛkpaayo nii kamɛ, di koto fututu nwu nte ni kaalɔ.”<verse eid="JOS 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 7:22" />Nioso Yosua lakpee batɔkyɛntɛ, baatoso baakyɛ lɛkpaayo nɔɔ, nfa aakookaa nya, di lɛkpaayo nɔɔ di koto fututu late ni kaalɔ nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 7:23" />Baayɔ asaa nwu di lɛkpaayo nwu kamɛ baakyɛnko Yosua ku Israel batii bamuu, ni baafukuti nya baatɛ di SAATE nwu anu nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 7:24" />Ninfɛ di Yosua ku Israel batii bamuu lakpaa Serah obisuɔtɔbi Akan ku koto fututu nwu, akpeele wua nwu, koto sɛɛle nwu, babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi nɔɔ, banankyue nɔɔ, babɔkɛɛ nɔɔ ba nintuka ni atoo, bafoso, lɛkpaayo nɔɔ ku asaa ya amuu niawɛ nwɔ nii baasifiko Akor Ɔtaata nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 7:25" />Ni di Yosua labuɛ alɛ, “Obe oso fɛɛyɔ dibuo le mmle feetika wo di suoto? SAATE kamayɔ dibuo antika fɔ di suoto miɛ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 7:25">Ninfɛ di Israel batii bamuu lasafɔ nwɔ afuɔ nɛ. Obe wɔ baasafɔ babule kafɔɔ afuɔ baaloo nii, ni baafiɛ ma nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 7:26" />Baasiisa afuɔ kplɛ ditii di Akan suoto, dite diɛbadu miɛ. Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu ɔblɔ yakayaka nwu kanya layɔɔ nɛ. Nioso diayɔ ni di obe nwu bɔɔlɛɛ lɛba nwu alɛ Akor Ɔtaata nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 7:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOS 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ai Olenkee Ku Kawɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 8:1" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ Yosua alɛ, “Tanyɛkɛ; tanta nnɛɛ lafee fɔ. Kpaa bakpɛtɛ bamuu fasifiko falaakpɛko Ai. Diekye ntɔɔyɔ Ai ɔka, batii nɔɔ ku okpoo nɔɔ ku kasɔ nɔɔ lekpee di nnɛɛ lɛfɔ. <verse eid="JOS 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 8:2" />Fababla Ai ku ɔka nɔɔ fɛ mmle faabla ni Yeriko ku ɔka nɔɔ. Kafɔɔ bibayɔ kakpɛ kamɛ asaa ku babɔkɛɛ sele lɛma minta suoto lee. Ta batii baate kalá di okpoo kplɛ nwu sɛmaa.”<verse eid="JOS 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 8:3" />Nioso Yosua ku bakpɛtɛ bamuu ladie baakyɛ baalaakpɛko Ai. Aadiki basuɔtɔ ba nin-ye ni kakpɛ nwaa nkpe afosi-atiɛ aakpee ku kakyɛ nwu <verse eid="JOS 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 8:4" />ku sɛlaa se mmle alɛ: “Bilolaa binu nwaa. Bita batii baate kalá di okpoo kplɛ nwu sɛmaa. Bitantɛ biakyo nwu. Bamuu lee bita atoko lee ate kaayi. <verse eid="JOS 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 8:5" />Ami ku mba bamuu ninkpe ni di ɔkyɛ nii kamakpɛ muntɔɔkyɛ okpoo kplɛ nwu, nse kafɔɔ basuɔtɔ nwu ledie bɛɛwa wo ɔkpɛko, fɛ mmle baabla ni obe nwu yi, bubatoso mundiɛ ma. <verse eid="JOS 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 8:6" />Babatikanko wo ninaase di obe wɔ bubakyɔnkyɔ ma mundiɛko ni di okpoo kplɛ nwu, diekye bababuɛ alɛ, ‘Bootoso wo fɛ mmle baabla ni obe nwu.’ Nioso nse buotoso buodiɛ ma, <verse eid="JOS 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 8:7" />biɛtaka di nfũ bite ni kalá biɛlaafũ okpoo kplɛ nwu. SAATE Yaa lee nwu kamayɔ nwu ankpee di nnɛɛ lee. <verse eid="JOS 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 8:8" />Nse bitoofũ okpoo kplɛ nwu, biekpee nwu ɔtɔ. Bibla nle di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ ye ni. Binyu bilɛ; bienu mi ɔlaa.”<verse eid="JOS 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 8:9" />Ninfɛ di Yosua ladiki ma osuku, ni baasifi lɛba le babate ni kalá nɛ. Ni baalate kala baasoko ma di Betel ku Ai obo diofe ni Ai kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ- kafɔɔ Yosua lawɛ di batii nwu ɔkyɛ ku kakyɛ nwu.<verse eid="JOS 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 8:10" />Kaleesɛ kuyitatũ, Yosua lalɛɛ bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ aasiisa, ni di nnwɔɔ ku Israel batunletɛ nwu lanafu baalaadu ma di Ai nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 8:11" />Bakpɛtɛ ba bamuu niawɛ ni di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ lanafu baakyɛ okpoo kplɛ nwu baalaadu nwu sitũ. Baasiɛ di Ai katoo-kasɔ, ku ɔtaata wɔ niate ma ni nintɛɛ ku okpoo kplɛ nwu. <verse eid="JOS 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 8:12" />Yosua lakpaa basuɔtɔ fɛ nkpe nnɔɔ, ni aata ma baate kalá di Betel ku Ai obo, diofe ni okpoo nwu kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 8:13" />Baata bakpɛtɛ nwu nyilakɔ lɛma- mba bamuu di kasiɛkɔ nwu kamɛ diofe ni okpoo kplɛ nwu katoo-kasɔ ku mba niate ni kalá diofe nwu ni kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ. Kakyɛ nwu nkpo Yosua lasifi aalaawɛ di ɔtaata nwu.<verse eid="JOS 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 8:14" />Obe wɔ di Ai ɔka lanya ni nle mmle, nnwɔɔ ku okpoo kplɛ basuɔtɔ bamuu lapɛsɛwa baadie ku kolesɛtũ baalaakyakako Israel batii ku kakpɛ di lɛba ninwii ninte diɛkyɔɔ ni Araba anu. Kafɔɔ atatofo alɛ bɛɛtɛ nwu kalá di okpoo kplɛ nwu sɛmaa. <verse eid="JOS 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 8:15" />Yosua ku Israel batii bamuu lata baakplesa ma sɛmaa di Ai batii anu, ninfɛ baatoso baatoofe ɔfaafuu nwu nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 8:16" />Ni baalɛɛ Ai basuɔtɔ bamuu alɛ bati ma nɛ. Nioso baatikanko Yosua, ni aakyɔnkyɔ ma aadieko di okpoo kplɛ nwu nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 8:17" />Osuɔtɔ kuonwii ditabu di Ai ee Betel atadie aati ni Israel batii. Baadiɛ okpoo kplɛ nwu baatɛ foee, baasifi baalaatikanko Israel batii.<verse eid="JOS 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 8:18" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ Yosua alɛ, “Bɔkɔtɛ lɛkplɔ le di kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ fakyɔɔ Ai, diekye nnɛɛ lɛfɔ kamayɔ okpoo kplɛ nwu nkpee.” Nioso Yosua labɔkɔtɛ lɛkplɔ nɔɔ nwu aakyɔɔ Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 8:19" />Nfanwu aabla ni ɔbla nkpo, ni di basuɔtɔ ba niate ni kalá lataka wla di kawofakɔ lɛma baakusa baawa sitũ nɛ. Baabuo okpoo kplɛ nwu, baafũ nwu ni baakpee nwu ɔtɔ wla nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 8:20" />Ai basuɔtɔ nwu lamunikĩi baanyu sɛmaa, ni baanya okpoo kplɛ nwu kɔyɔ kɔtaka kunfe kolo nɛ, kafɔɔ lɛbla le kuninwii nnaa ma baatoso manfe ni di osuku owo suoto. Diekye Israel batii nwu niatootoso baatoofe ni ɔfaafuu ntoomunikĩi bɛɛkyɔɔ batikankotɛ lɛma nwu anu. <verse eid="JOS 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 8:21" />Diekye obe wɔ di Yosua ku Israel batii bamuu lanya alɛ mba niate ni kalá ntoofũ ni okpoo kplɛ nwu, di kɔyɔ kafɔɔ kodie ni di okpoo kplɛ nwu kunfe ni osi yi, baamunikĩi baatu baabuo di Ai basuɔtɔ nwu suoto. <verse eid="JOS 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 8:22" />Basuɔtɔ ba niate ni kalá kafɔɔ ladie di okpoo kplɛ nwu bababuo ma di suoto, diata alɛ Ai batii laka nintɛɛ, di Israel batii lawɛ ni di sitũ ku sɛmaa lɛma. Israel batii lalo ma, batabu bia mba ninkpe ni nkpa ee mba nikotososo nii. <verse eid="JOS 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 8:23" />Kafɔɔ baamufũ Ai ɔka ku nkpa, ni baakpaa nwɔ baawako Yosua nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 8:24" />Obe wɔ di Israel batii laloo ni Ai batii bamuu olo di afe ku ɔfaafuu wɔ kamɛ baati ma nii, di obe wɔ kafɔɔ baalo ni obiala ku kapamii yi, Israel batii bamuu lakple baasifi Ai baalaalo mba niawɛ ni ninfa. <verse eid="JOS 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 8:25" />Batii ba bamuu nianɔɔ ni di Ai dii nwu nkpo- basuɔtɔ ku basanko labla lefosi nkpe nnyɔ. <verse eid="JOS 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 8:26" />Diekye Yosua ditakplesa kɔnɛɛ ko niananfi ni lɛkplɔ nɔɔ dialaase di obe wɔ aawɔɔsa ni batii ba bamuu niasiɛ ni di Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 8:27" />Kafɔɔ Israel batii layɔ babɔkɛɛ sele ku kakpɛ asaa di okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle baata suoto lɛma, fɛ mmle di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ ni Yosua.<verse eid="JOS 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 8:28" />Nioso Yosua lafiɛ Ai aabla nwu kawɔɔ ditii ninamayɛ ni diidii, lɛba le ninte ni fooo, bia miɛ. <verse eid="JOS 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 8:29" />Ni di Yosua layɔ Ai ɔka aasaka di kowoso suoto, aadiɛ nwɔ ninfa dialaadu kɔtɔɔfɔ nɛ. Di kufĩ lamɛɛ nii, Yosua latɔkɔ ma alɛ balaasakatɛ kpi nɔɔ di kowoso nwu suoto, baalaafuki nwɔ batɛ di okpoo nwu kasũkunya. Ni baasiisa afuɔ kplɛ ditii di suoto nɔɔ, diɛka dite ninfa bia miɛ.<verse eid="JOS 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baaka Kufiofa Nwu Di Ebal Kobokote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 8:30" />Ninfɛ di Yosua lapɛ oleɔta akyikye di Ebal Kobokote osi aata SAATE, Israel Yaa nwu, <verse eid="JOS 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 8:31" />fɛ mmle di SAATE nwu tɔkyɛntɛ Mose latɔkɔ ni Israel batii nɛ. Aapɛ nya di mmle kanya bɛɛkpana ni di Mose Kufiofa Kukũ kamɛ alɛ- oleɔta akyikye afuɔ ya suoto batayɔ lɛbɔɔsaa lɛkpɛnsaa baablako ni ɔkpɛ. Nnya suoto baata SAATE nwu ofiɛ asaaɔta ku atoko ɔkyɛ ole oleɔta asaaɔta nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 8:32" />Nfa, di Israel batii nwu anu, di Yosua lase Mose kufiofa nwu lɛkpana otika di afuɔ nwu suoto, nko di Mose lakpana nii. <verse eid="JOS 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 8:33" />Ninfɛ di Israel batii bamuu, bafɔɔ ku okpoo batii bamuu ku okpoo banɔɔfo, banɔɔfotii ku bakantɛ lɛma layila di SAATE nwu kanya ninii lɛlakaa kakyɛka ku kakyɛka, baakyɔɔ mba niatuka ni ni anu- olebatatɛ ba niale ni Lewi batii. Batii nwu kakyɛ layila di Gerisim Kobokote katũ, kakyɛ lɛma bule kafɔɔ di Ebal Kobokote katũ, fɛ mmle di SAATE nwu kpɛmblatɛ Mose labuɛ ni saa, di obe wɔ aakaalɛ ni lɛtɔtrɔ aata ni Israel batii.<verse eid="JOS 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 8:34" />Nni sɛmaa, Yosua laka kufiofa nwu sɛlaa simuu- lɛtɔtrɔ ku akpaani- fɛ mmle bɛɛkpana ni di Kufiofa Kukũ nwu kamɛ. <verse eid="JOS 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 8:35" />Ɔlaa kuonwii ditabu di nse simuu di Mose labuɛ ni di Yosua ditaka aata ni Israel dikudi nwu nimuu, di basanko ku babisɔ ku bafɔɔ ba ninsi ni kaamɛ lɛma nkyakaa nii.<verse eid="JOS 8:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOS 9" />
  <para style="s1">Gibeon Batii Lakyɔnkyɔ Yosua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 9:1" />Di obe wɔ di baka ba bamuu niawɛ ni di Yordan kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ lanu ni sɛlaa se mmle- mba di lekpenkpe kale ku kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ akpenkpe nkpaa ku Lekpo Kplɛ kotoko basiɛtɛ bamuu, dialaadu bia Lebanon (Heti batii, Amori batii, Kanaan batii, Perisi batii, Hewi batii ku Yebusi batii baka)- <verse eid="JOS 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 9:2" />lasi baabla onwii di Yosua ku Israel suoto.<verse eid="JOS 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 9:3" />Kafɔɔ di Gibeon batii lanu ni lɛsaa le di Yosua labla ni Yeriko ku Ai yi, <verse eid="JOS 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 9:4" />baafe di kakyɔnkyɔ osuku: Baakyɛ fɛ kɔtɔ bakyɛntɛ ba di babɔkɛɛ ba nintuka ni atoo nintuka ni bakotoku tɔle ku nta akukuuku kofole ya niebibiɛ beetĩtĩi nii. <verse eid="JOS 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 9:5" />Basuɔtɔ nwu lakpee ntokota bɛbɛɛle bɛɛkakaa ni ninkpaa lɛma, baakpee kafɔɔ akpeele kofole. Bloblo ku alesaa lɛma ya amuu baaklee ni laklee aakoso aapɛ kufuta. <verse eid="JOS 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 9:6" />Ni baakyɛ Yosua nfũ di kasiɛkɔ nɔɔ di Gilgal baalaatɔkɔ nnwɔɔ ku Israel batii alɛ, "Buokye kale kyonle buɔwa; buomiɛ bulɛ bibla kanya ninii ku awo.”<verse eid="JOS 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 9:7" />Ni di Israel batii latɔkɔ Hewi batii alɛ, “Kafɔɔ loobia bisi bikaako wo. Ni lɛ nfɛ buabla kanya ninii ku aye?”<verse eid="JOS 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 9:8" />Ninfɛ baatɔkɔ Yosua alɛ, “Bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ bule.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 9:8">Kafɔɔ Yosua lakaalɛ ma alɛ, “Bawe bile, ɔfɛ kafɔɔ biekye?”<verse eid="JOS 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 9:9" />Ni baabuɛ alɛ: “Bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ lekye kale ka niɛtɛ keekyo ni, ta SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ leyooto oso. Diekye butoonu nwɔ suoto sɛlaa: asaa ya amuu aabla ni di Egipte, <verse eid="JOS 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 9:10" />ku asaa ya amuu aabla ni baka nwu banyɔ ninle ni Amori batii ɔka di Yordan kufĩ katunkɔ- Hesbon ɔka Sihon ku Basan ɔka Og wɔ niale ni sɛka di Astarot. <verse eid="JOS 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 9:11" />Ni di banɔɔfo loo ku mba ninsi ni di kale loo latɔkɔ wo alɛ, ‘Biyɔ alesaa biklee bita osuku lee ɔkyɛ; bikyɛ biɛlaakyakako ma, biɛtɔkɔ ma bilɛ, “Bakpɛmblatɛ lee bule; bibla kanya ninii ku awo.” ’ <verse eid="JOS 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 9:12" />Alesaa loo ya mmle lafila di obe wɔ buayɔ nya ni leeyo di dii le buadie bulɛ buɔwa ni ɔkyɛ lee. Kafɔɔ nunua binyu mmle atookoso ɛɛpɛ ni kufuta. <verse eid="JOS 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 9:13" />Nta akuuku ya mmle afɔle aale fiɛ buakpete nta, kafɔɔ binyu mmle atomumuɛ ni. Akpeele ku ntokota loo ntɔɔbɛbɛɛ ta osuku nkyonle ɔkyɛ oso.”<verse eid="JOS 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 9:14" />Nioso Israel batii lafũ alesaa lɛma nwu, kafɔɔ batakaalɛ SAATE nwu banu fiɛ. <verse eid="JOS 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 9:15" />Ninfɛ di Yosua lanii atoko ɔkyɛ ole kanya ku Gibeon batii alɛ basiɛ ninfa, ni di dikudi nwu batunletɛ laka ntam baata ma nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 9:16" />Di ayi atiɛ sɛmaa, baanii ni kanya ku Gibeon batii yi, Israel batii lanu alɛ bawo lɛma bale basi bakaako ma nii. <verse eid="JOS 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 9:17" />Nioso Israel batii layefe osuku, di dii tiɛfa baabuo sekpoo kplɛ lɛma nwu: Gibeon, Kefira, Beerot ku Kiriat Yearim. <verse eid="JOS 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 9:18" />Kafɔɔ Israel batii ditadieko ma, diekye dikudi nwu batunletɛ laka ntam di SAATE, Israel Yaa nwu suoto baata ma.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 9:18">Ninfɛ di Israel batii bamuu lakakakatɛ di batunletɛ nwu suoto nɛ, <verse eid="JOS 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 9:19" />kafɔɔ batunletɛ nwu bamuu latɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Butɔɔka ntam loo di SAATE, Israel Yaa nwu suoto buɔta ma, nkpo oso bulaafuo ma ɔkpanko nunua. <verse eid="JOS 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 9:20" />Nnya lɛsaa le bubabla ma ni: Bubata ma mansiɛ, ta mmle di ɔblɔ dilɔbawa wo ni di suoto ta buotũ ni ntam be buɔka buɔta ma ni oso.” <verse eid="JOS 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 9:21" />Baakple baabuɛ alɛ, “Bita ma basiɛ, kafɔɔ bita ma bale awosoku babuditɛ ku ntu badutɛ bata okpoo omuu.” Nioso baafũ batunletɛ nwu ɔlaa baakpee.<verse eid="JOS 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 9:22" />Ninfɛ di Yosua lalɛɛ Gibeon batii aakaalɛ alɛ, “Obe oso biɛkyɔnkyɔ wo bilɛ, ‘Lɛba le busi ni lekyo ku aye,’ obe wɔ di nwaako bisi bikaako wo ni? <verse eid="JOS 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 9:23" />Nunua lɛkpaani kalɔ nfɛ bisi: Bilɔbadiɛ awosoku obudi ku ntu odu ɔta di Yaa nii leyo.”<verse eid="JOS 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 9:24" />Ninfɛ baatɔkɔ Yosua alɛ, “Baatɛ baatɔkɔ bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ mmle nwu di SAATE, Yaa lɛfɔ latɔkɔ ni kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ Mose alɛ ayɔ kasɔ nwu kamuu ata ye ni, ku mmle biaawɔɔsa ni kasɔ nwu batii bamuu di anu lee. Nioso buayɛkɛ nkpa loo ta aye oso, nkpo oso buabla nle mmle nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 9:25" />Nunua nfɛ busi di nnɛɛ lɛfɔ. Bla wo lɛsaa lele ninlɛ, diesiɛko ni kafɔɔ diɛta fɔ ni.”<verse eid="JOS 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 9:26" />Nioso Yosua lafũ ma nkpa di Israel batii nnɛɛ, nkpo oso batalo ma. <verse eid="JOS 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 9:27" />Dii nwu nkpo, Yosua layɔ Gibeon batii aabla awosoku babuditɛ ku ntu badutɛ aata Israel batii ku SAATE nwu oleɔta akyikye, di lɛba le di SAATE nwu kamatuo nii. Nkpo kafɔɔ bate bia miɛ nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOS 10" />
  <para style="s1">Israel Batii Lalenkee Amori Batii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 10:1" />Ninfɛ di Yerusalem ɔka Adoni-Sedek lanu alɛ Yosua ntoofũ Ai okpoo kplɛ nwu, ɛɛwɔɔsa nwu kafɔɔ fɛɛ, ɛɛbla Ai fɛ mmle aabla ni Yeriko ku ɔka lɛma, ni di Gibeon batii kafɔɔ ntɔɔbla atoko ɔkyɛ ole kanya ninii ku Israel, nioso nfɛ basi bakaako ma. <verse eid="JOS 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 10:2" />Diatɛ diabla Yerusalem ɔka ku batii nɔɔ ɔkpɛ di nle mmle nwu oso, diekye Gibeon lale okpoo kplɛ finle, fɛle baka sekpoo kplɛ onwii; kuamuɔ kualenkee Ai, basuɔtɔ ninwu bamuu kafɔɔ lale bakpɛtɛ nwaa. <verse eid="JOS 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 10:3" />Nioso Yerusalem ɔka Adoni-Sedek latikiti Hebron ɔka Hoham, Yarmut ɔka Piram, Lakis ɔka Yafia ku Eglon ɔka Debir lekoto. <verse eid="JOS 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 10:4" />Aabuɛ alɛ, “Biwa biɛbakyakaako mi buɔlaakpɛ Gibeon, diekye batoonii atoko ɔkyɛ ole kanya ku Yosua ku Israel batii.”<verse eid="JOS 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 10:5" />Ninfɛ di Amori batii baka banɔɔ nwu-Yerusalem, Hebron, Yarmut, Lakis ku Eglon baka-lasiisa bakpɛtɛ lɛma dikudi. Ni baadie baakata baasifi ku bakpɛtɛ lɛma bamuu baalaayila baakpɛko Gibeon nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 10:6" />Ni di Gibeon batii lata Yosua kanya di kasiɛkɔ nɔɔ di Gilgal alɛ, “Tandiɛ bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ nnɛɛ. Wa wla faabafũ wo! Kyakaako wo, diekye Amori batii baka bamuu niekye ni akpenkpe kale nwu lesiisa bakpɛtɛ dikudi di suoto loo.”<verse eid="JOS 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 10:7" />Nioso Yosua lakata aakye Gilgal ku bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ bamuu, di basuɔtɔ ba bamuu niɛtɛ baye ni kakpɛ nwaa lasiɛ ni kaamɛ. <verse eid="JOS 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 10:8" />Ni di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ Yosua alɛ, “Tanyɛkɛ ma; ntɔɔyɔ ma lekpee di nnɛɛ lɛfɔ. Kuonwii lɛma dilɔbafuo fɔ oyilako.”<verse eid="JOS 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 10:9" />Yosua ladie di Gilgal, baakyɛ kakyɛ-kamuu baalaafua ma. <verse eid="JOS 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 10:10" />Ni di SAATE nwu lakpɔkpɔtɔsa ma di Israel batii anu, ni baalenkee ma di lelenkee kplɛ kamɛ di Gibeon nɛ. Israel batii latikanko ma di osuku wɔ ninte kuosifi ni Bet Horon, baalaalo ma bamuu baatɛ di osuku baalaadu Aseka ku Makeda. <verse eid="JOS 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 10:11" />Baatootoso ni di Israel batii anu di osuku wɔ niekye ni Bet Horon kuosifi ni Aseka, SAATE lafuki atubakani kplɛkplɛ aakye osi aakpete ma di suoto. Kpinwu lɛma lakpi di atubakani nwu kamɛ baalenkee mba baalo ni ku Israel batii mpamii.<verse eid="JOS 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 10:12" />Di dii le di SAATE nwu layɔ Amori batii aakpee ni di Israel nnɛɛ yi, Yosua latɔkɔ SAATE nwu di Israel batii anu alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOS 10:12">“Oo kufĩ, yila kloklo di Gibeon suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOS 10:12">Oo kɔwɛntɛ, layila di Ayalon Ɔtaata nwu suoto.”<verse eid="JOS 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 10:13" />Nioso kufĩ layila kloklo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOS 10:13">kɔwɛntɛ kafɔɔ layila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOS 10:13">dialaase di obe wɔ di kale nwu labla balo lɛma baakyisa nii,</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JOS 10:13">fɛ mmle bɛɛkpana ni di Yasser Kukũ kamɛ alɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 10:13">Kufĩ layila di kolo ntɛɛntɛɛ, kuaku nkpaa kuamɛɛ nii, fɛ dii kufĩ kumu. <verse eid="JOS 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 10:14" />Dii fɛ nle mmle diiwa diidii ee saa, dii le di SAATE nwu lakyɔɔ ni otii atoko. Nwaako SAATE nwu latɔɔkpɛ aatɔɔta Israel!<verse eid="JOS 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 10:15" />Ninfɛ di Yosua ku Israel batii bamuu lakple baasifi kasiɛkɔ lɛma di Gilgal nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yosua Lamufũ Amori Batii Baka Nwu Banɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 10:16" />Ninfɛ di baka nwu banɔɔ latoso baalaawofa di ofuɔntuu kamɛ di Makeda nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 10:17" />Obe wɔ baatɔkɔ ni Yosua alɛ bɛɛnya baka nwu banɔɔ lewofa ni di ofuɔntuu kamɛ di Makeda yi, <verse eid="JOS 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 10:18" />ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Bimunusa afuɔ kplɛ bitĩi ofuɔntuu nwu kanya, biɛta basuɔtɔ bawo bawɛ ninfa batoonyu nwu. <verse eid="JOS 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 10:19" />Kafɔɔ bitanyila! Bitikanko balo lee, bilo ma bikyeko sɛmaa, sɛmaa, bitanta ma balaadu sekpoo kplɛ lɛma, diekye SAATE, Yaa lee nwu ntɔɔyɔ ma eekpee ye ninnɛɛ.”<verse eid="JOS 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 10:20" />Nioso Yosua ku Israel batii lawɔɔsa ma fɛɛ-kɛɛkɛɛ nse otii kuonwii ditabu-kafɔɔ basɛɛ ba niabu ni lalabuo sekpoo kplɛ lɛma se baatofo seyoyiɛ baakyisa nii. <verse eid="JOS 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 10:21" />Ninfɛ di bakpɛtɛ nwu bamuu lakple buɛɛ baasifi Yosua nfũ di kasiɛkɔ nwu di Makeda nɛ. Kuonwii kafɔɔ ditabɛ kanya di Israel batii suoto.<verse eid="JOS 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 10:22" />Ninfɛ di Yosua labuɛ alɛ, “Bitikiti ofuɔntuu nwu kanya biediki baka nwu banɔɔ bawakoe.” <verse eid="JOS 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 10:23" />Nioso baalaadiki baka nwu banɔɔ di ofuɔntuu nwu kamɛ baawako- Yerusalem, Hebron, Yarmut, Lakis ku Eglon baka nwu. <verse eid="JOS 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 10:24" />Obe wɔ baakpaa baka ba mmle baawako ni Yosua, aalɛɛ Israel basuɔtɔ bamuu, ni aatɔkɔ kakpɛ kanyabayilatɛ ba niawa ni ku nnwɔɔ alɛ, “Biwa ninfũ biɛbayɔ nkpaa lee bitika di baka ba mmle simu.” Nioso baadie baawa sitũ babayɔ nkpaa lɛma baatika di simu lɛma.<verse eid="JOS 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 10:25" />Ni di Yosua latɔkɔ kakpɛ kanyabayilatɛ nwu alɛ, “Bitanyɛkɛ; bitanta nnɛɛ lafee ye. Biwɛ osie biekpee otu kafɔɔ. Nnya nle di SAATE nwu kamabla ni balo ba bamuu biofe ni ɔkpɛko.” <verse eid="JOS 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 10:26" />Ninfɛ di Yosua lalo baka nwu, aayɔ ma aasaka di awoso anɔɔ suoto, ni baadiɛ ma baasaka di awoso nwu suoto dialaadu kɔtɔɔfɔ nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 10:27" />Di kufĩ lamɛɛ nii, Yosua lata osuku alɛ basakatɛ ma di awoso nwu suoto baafuki ma baakpee di ofuɔntuu wɔ baawofa ni kamɛ. Baayɔ afuɔ kplɛkplɛ baatĩi ofuɔntuu nwu kanya, ate ninfa diɛbadu miɛ dii le mmle.<verse eid="JOS 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yosua Lafũ Amori Batii Kasɔ Aakyakaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 10:28" />Dii nwu nkpo Yosua lafũ Makeda. Aalo okpoo kplɛ nwu batii ku ɔka lɛma ku kapamii aawɔɔsa otii biala kaamɛ ninwu fɛɛ. Atabu kubanwii basiɛ nkpa. Ni aabla Makeda ɔka fɛ mmle aabla ni Yeriko ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 10:29" />Ninfɛ di Yosua ku Israel batii bamuu di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ ladie di Makeda baasifi baalaakpɛko Libna nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 10:30" />SAATE nwu kafɔɔ layɔ okpoo kplɛ nwu ku ɔka ninwu aakpee di Israel batii nnɛɛ. Yosua lalo otii biala di okpoo kplɛ nwu ku kapamii. Atabu kubanwii basiɛ nkpa ninfa. Ni aabla ɔka ninwu fɛ mmle aabla ni Yeriko ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 10:31" />Ninfɛ di Yosua ku Israel batii bamuu di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ ladie di Libna baasifi Lakis; ni aayila aakpɛko nwu nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 10:32" />SAATE nwu layɔ Lakis aakpee di Israel nnɛɛ, ni di Yosua lafũ nwu di dii nyɔɔfa suoto nɛ. Aalo otii biala di okpoo kplɛ nwu ku kapamii, fɛ mmle aabla ni Libna. <verse eid="JOS 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 10:33" />Nu di Geser ɔka Horam lawa aabakyakaako Lakis, kafɔɔ Yosua lalenkee nnwɔɔ ku bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ- dialaase di obe wɔ di kubanwii ditabu basiɛ ni nkpa.<verse eid="JOS 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 10:34" />Ninfɛ di Yosua ku Israel batii bamuu di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ ladie di Lakis baasifi Eglon; ni baayila baakpɛko nwu nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 10:35" />Baafũ okpoo nwu di dii nwu suoto, baalo ma ku kapamii, baawɔɔsa otii biala fɛɛ ninwu kamɛ, fɛ mmle baabla ni Lakis.<verse eid="JOS 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 10:36" />Ninfɛ di Yosua ku Israel batii bamuu di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ ladie di Eglon baasifi Hebron baalaakpɛko nwu nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 10:37" />Baafũ okpoo kplɛ nwu, baalo ma ku ɔka ninwu ku sekpooenyii ninwu ku otii biala ninwu kamɛ ku kapamii. Batabu kubanwii basiɛ nkpa. Fɛ mmle baabla ni di Eglon, baawɔɔsa Eglon fɛɛ ku otii biala ninwu kamɛ.<verse eid="JOS 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 10:38" />Ninfɛ di Yosua ku Israel batii bamuu di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ lamunikĩi baalaakpɛko Debir nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 10:39" />Baafũ okpoo kplɛ nwu, ni baalo ma ku ɔka ninwu ku sekpooenyii ninwu ku kapamii nɛ. Baawɔɔsa otii biala ninwu kamɛ fɛɛ. Batabu kubanwii basiɛ nkpa. Baabla Debir ku ɔka ninwu fɛ mmle baabla ni di Libna ku ɔka nɔɔ ku Hebron.<verse eid="JOS 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 10:40" />Nioso Yosua lalenkee kasɔ nwu kamuu di lekpenkpe kale nkyakaa ni ku Kalakasɔ, ku kufĩkamɛɛkɔ akpenkpe nkpaa ku kobokote nkyɛlɛlɛkɔ nwu ku baka lɛma bamuu. Atabu kubanwii basiɛ nkpa. Aawɔɔsa mba ninwuna ni bamuu fɛɛ, fɛ mmle di SAATE, Israel Yaa nwu ladiki nwɔ ni kanya. <verse eid="JOS 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 10:41" />Yosua lalenkee ma diakye ni di Kades Barnea dialaadu ni Gasa, diakye kafɔɔ di Gosen kasɔ kamuu dialaadu Gibeon. <verse eid="JOS 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 10:42" />Yosua lalenkee baka ba mmle ku nsɔ lɛma di obe onwii kamɛ, diekye SAATE, Israel Yaa nwu lakpɛ aata Israel.<verse eid="JOS 10:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 10:43" />Ninfɛ di Yosua ku Israel batii bamuu lakple baasifi kasiɛkɔ lɛma nwu di Gilgal nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 10:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOS 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yosua Lalenkee Yabin Ku Baklopo Nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 11:1" />Obe wɔ di Hasor ɔka Yabin lanu ni ɔlaa wɔ mmle, ni aata kanya Madon ɔka Yobab, Simron, Aksaf baka, <verse eid="JOS 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 11:2" />ku katoo-kasɔ baka ba niawɛ ni di abokote suoto di Araba di Kinerot kala kasɔ, di kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ akpenkpe nkpaa ku Nafot Dor di kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ; <verse eid="JOS 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 11:3" />ku Kanaan batii di kufĩ katunkɔ ku kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ; ku Amori batii, Heti batii, Perisi batii ku Yebusi batii di lekpenkpe kale suoto; ku Hewi batii di Hermon Kobokote kalɔ di Mispa kasɔ suoto nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 11:4" />Ni baadie baawa ku bakpɛtɛ lɛma bamuu ku bapɔnkɔ sɛlambu kplɛ ku bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni-bakpɛtɛ dikudi kplɛkplɛ di lɛpɔ late ni fɛ ɔtɛnsĩa di lekpo kotoko. <verse eid="JOS 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 11:5" />Baka ba mmle bamuu lasiisa bakpɛtɛ, ni baabla kasiɛkɔ kanwii di Merom Ntu katũ alɛ babakpɛko Israel nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 11:6" />Ni di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ Yosua alɛ, “Tanyɛkɛ ma, diekye kɔsɛɛ nuakpa okle kamayɔ ma bamuu nkpee di Israel nnɛɛ, beelo ma nii. Bibubudi bapɔnkɔ lɛma sɛkpaakũ, biɛfiɛ kafɔɔ bakeke lɛma ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni.”<verse eid="JOS 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 11:7" />Nioso Yosua ku bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ bamuu ladie baabafua ma di Merom Ntu katũ baakpɛko ma. <verse eid="JOS 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 11:8" />Ni di SAATE nwu layɔ ma aakpee di Israel nnɛɛ nɛ. Baalenkee ma, ni baatikanko ma baalaadu Sidon Kplɛkplɛ ku Misrefot Maim ku Mispa Ɔtaata nwu di kufĩ katunkɔ, dialaase di obe wɔ di kubanwii ditabu basiɛ ni nkpa. <verse eid="JOS 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 11:9" />Yosua labla ma fɛ mmle di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ nwɔ nii: Aabubudi bapɔnkɔ lɛma sɛkpaakũ ni aafiɛ bakeke lɛma ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi nii.<verse eid="JOS 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 11:10" />Di obe nwu kamɛ Yosua lakple nkpaamaa aalaafũ Hasor okpoo, aalo ɔka lɛma ku kapamii. (Hasor niale disi di sɛka nlekɔ be mmle mmuu nɛ.) <verse eid="JOS 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 11:11" />Baalo obiala di Hasor okpoo kamɛ ku kapamii. Baawɔɔsa ma fɛɛ, batadiɛ lɛsalɛsaa ninwuna nii, ni aafiɛ Hasor nwu omu nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 11:12" />Yosua lafũ sɛka-kpoo se mmle, ni aalo baka lɛma ku kapamii nɛ. Aawɔɔsa ma klekle, fɛ mmle di SAATE nwu kpɛmblatɛ Mose labuɛ nii. <verse eid="JOS 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 11:13" />Kafɔɔ Israel ditafiɛ sekpoo kplɛ se niatika ni di akpenkpe lɛma osi kuonwii- diediki Hasor wɔ di Yosua lafiɛ nii. <verse eid="JOS 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 11:14" />Ni di Israel batii latuka kakpɛ kamɛ asaa amuu ku babɔkɛɛ sele lɛma bamuu di sekpoo kplɛ se mmle baasifiko nɛ. Kafɔɔ baalo batii nwu bamuu ku kapamii dialaase di obe wɔ baawɔɔsa ma ni klekle, batabu kuonwii ninwuna nii. <verse eid="JOS 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 11:15" />Fɛ mmle di SAATE nwu ladiki ni kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ Mose kanya, nkpo kafɔɔ di Mose latɔkɔ Yosua, ni di Yosua kafɔɔ labla ni nɛ; aabla asaa ya amuu di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ ni Mose.<verse eid="JOS 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kasɔ Ka Di Yosua Lafũ Nii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 11:16" />Nioso Yosua lafũ kasɔ ka mmle kamuu: lekpenkpe kale nwu ku Kalakasɔ kamuu, Gosen kasɔ kamuu ku kufĩkamɛɛkɔ akpenkpe nkpaa ku Araba ku Israel abokote ku akpenkpe nkpaa lɛnya. <verse eid="JOS 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 11:17" />Diayɔ ni di Halak Kobokote ko nikofe ni Seir, dialaadu ni Baal Gad di Lebanon Ɔtaata di Hermon Kobokote kalɔ. Aamufũ baka lɛma bamuu, ni aapɛpɛɛ ma aalo nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 11:18" />Yosua lakpɛko baka ba mmle bamuu diaklɛ. <verse eid="JOS 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 11:19" />Okpoo kplɛ kuonwii ditabla atoko ɔkyɛ ole kanya ninii ku Israel batii, diediki Hewi batii ba niasiɛ ni di Gibeon, kafɔɔ sekpoo kplɛ se mmle simuu ladieko ma kakpɛ. <verse eid="JOS 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 11:20" />Diekye SAATE nwu omu niata situ lɛma lawɛ osie alɛ bakpɛko Israel, ta mmle aawɔɔsa ma ni klekle oso, andiki ma ni ku nyaami ɔtanya, fɛ mmle di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ ni Mose.<verse eid="JOS 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 11:21" />Di obe nwu kamɛ Yosua lakyɛ aalaawɔɔsa Anak batii di lekpenkpe kale nwu: diayɔ ni di Hebron, Debir ku Anab, diayɔ ni di Yuda lekpenkpe kale kamuu ku Israel lekpenkpe kale kamuu. Yosua lawɔɔsa ma klekle ku sekpoo lɛma nwu. <verse eid="JOS 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 11:22" />Anak batii kuonwii ditabu di Israel kasɔ suoto; Gasa ku Gad ku Asdod lete di bawo labu. <verse eid="JOS 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 11:23" />Nioso Yosua lafũ kasɔ nwu kamuu, fɛ mmle di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ ni Mose kanya, ni aayɔ ka aata Israel fɛ atesaa di ana lɛma akudi kanya nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 11:23">Ninfɛ di kakpɛ latɛ ɔnyɛɛ di kasɔ nwu suoto nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 11:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOS 12" />
  <para style="s1">Baka Ba Di Mose Lalenkee Nii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 12:1" />Nnya nsɔ be baka di Israel batii lalenkee ni ku mba nsɔ baafũ ni di Yordan kufĩ katunkɔ. Diayɔ ni di Arnon Kɔwɛ dialaadu Hermon Kobokote, di Araba kufĩ katunkɔ lɛkyɛ nimuu nsi ni kaamɛ:<verse eid="JOS 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 12:2" />Amori batii ɔka Sihon,</para>
  <para style="mi" vid="JOS 12:2">wɔ niale ni sɛka di Hesbon. Aale sɛka diayɔ ni di Aroer di Arnon Kɔwɛ kotoko- diayɔ di kɔwɛ nwu ntɛɛntɛɛ- dialaadu Yabok Okle wɔ ninle ni Amon batii kɔmɛ. Di Gilead-kakyɛ nsi ni kaamɛ. <verse eid="JOS 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 12:3" />Aale sɛka kafɔɔ di Araba kufĩ katunkɔ suoto, diayɔ ni di Kinerot Lekpo dialaadu Araba Lekpo (Mmba Lekpo), dialaadu Bet Yesimot, ni diafe di Pisga abokote lɛkyɛlɛlɛɛ kala kasɔ nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 12:4" />Ku Basan ɔka Og kasɔ,</para>
  <para style="mi" vid="JOS 12:4">Refait batii nwu yɛntɛle onwii wɔ niale ni sɛka di Astarot ku Edrei. <verse eid="JOS 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 12:5" />Aale sɛka di Hermon Kobokote suoto, Salka, Basan omuu dialaadu Gesur ku Maakat batii kɔmɛ, ku Gilead kakyɛ dialaadu Hesbon ɔka Sihon kɔmɛ.<verse eid="JOS 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 12:6" />SAATE nwu kpɛmblatɛ, Mose ku Israel batii lalenkee ma. Ni di SAATE nwu kpɛmblatɛ Mose layɔ kasɔ lɛma nwu aata Ruben batii, Gad batii ku Manase kɔna-kakyɛ nwu alɛ kabla kalema nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 12:7" />Mba mmle ninle kasɔ baka ba di Yosua ku Israel batii lalenkee ni di Yordan kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ lɛkyɛ nɛ. Diayɔ ni di Baal Gad di Lebanon Ɔtaata nwu dialaadu ni Halak Kobokote diofe ni Seir lɛkyɛ (nsɔ lɛma nwu di Yosua layɔ aata ni Israel ana nwu fɛ atesaa di ana lɛma letembi kanya nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 12:8" />Akpenkpe nwu kale ku kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ akpenkpe nkpaa ku Araba, abokote nwu nkyɛlɛlɛkɔ, ɔfaafuu nwu ku Kalakasɔ- Heti batii, Amori batii, Kanaan batii, Perisi batii, Hewi batii ku Yebusi batii nsɔ):<verse eid="JOS 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <table>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 12:9" />Yeriko ɔka</cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">onwii</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">Ai ɔka (ninkaako ni Betel) </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">onwii</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="JOS 12:9" />
        <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 12:10" />Yerusalem ɔka</cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">onwii</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">Hebron ɔka</cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">onwii</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
