  </table>
  <para style="m" vid="JOS 12:24">bamuu labla baka afosi-atiɛ-onwii<verse eid="JOS 12:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOS 13" />
  <para style="s1">Kasɔ Ka Niekple Keebu Baakple Manfũ Nii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 13:1" />Obe wɔ di Yosua ntoobe, atɔɔkyɛ ni sitũ di alɛɛ kamɛ yi, SAATE nwu latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, "Fatɔɔtɛ feebe, kasɔ ka kafɔɔ niɛtɛ kapɔ baafũ ni lekple kate.<verse eid="JOS 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 13:2" />“Nnya kasɔ ka niebu ni: Filisti batii ku Gesur batii nsɔ mmuu: <verse eid="JOS 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 13:3" />diɛyɔ ni di Sihor Okle di Egipte kufĩ katunkɔ diesifi ni Ekron kasɔ di katoo-kasɔ, baayɔ ma bamuu fɛ Kanaan batii (Filisti batii baka nwu banɔɔ kasɔ di Gasa, Asdod, Askelon, Gat ku Ekron- nka ninle ni Awi batii kale). <verse eid="JOS 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 13:4" />Diɛyɔ ni di kala kasɔ, Kanaan batii kasɔ nwu kamuu, diɛyɔ di Ara wɔ ninle ni Sidon batii kale diɛlaadu ni bia Afek ninle ni Amori batii kasɔ, <verse eid="JOS 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 13:5" />Gebal batii obo nwu; ku Lebanon omuu diɛlaadu ni kufĩ katunkɔ, diɛyɔ di Baal Gad di Hermon Kobokote kalɔ diɛlaadu ni Lebo Hamat.<verse eid="JOS 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 13:6" />“Mba bamuu ninle ni abokote nsɔ nwu basiɛtɛ, diɛyɔ ni di Lebanon diɛlaadu ni Misrefot Maim, ninle ni Sidon batii bamuu yi, ami omu kamatososa ma ndiki di Israel batii anu. Nyu nwaa falɛ fɛɛsɛ kasɔ ka mmle fɛɛta Israel diɛta ni atesaa, fɛ mmle lɛtɔkɔ fɔ nii, <verse eid="JOS 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 13:7" />faasɛ kasɔ nwu fɛ atesaa fata ana anaasĩ nwu ku Manase kɔna-kakyɛ nwu.”<verse eid="JOS 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yordan Kufĩ Katunkɔ Nwu Kasɔ Ɔsɛ</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 13:8" />Manase kɔna-kakyɛ nwu nyɔɔfa, Ruben batii ku Gad batii ntoofũ atesaa ya di Mose lata ma di Yordan kufĩ katunkɔ, fɛle nnwɔɔ, SAATE nwu kpɛmblatɛ niayɔ ka aata ma nii.<verse eid="JOS 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 13:9" />Kaadie di Aroer di Arnon Ɔtaata kotoko, kɛɛyɔ kafɔɔ di ɔtaata nwu okpoo ntɛɛ, di Medeba ɔtaata omuu nsi ni kaamɛ kɛɛlaadu bia Dibon, <verse eid="JOS 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 13:10" />ku Amori batii ɔka Sihon wɔ niale ni sɛka di Hesbon sekpoo simuu, diɛlaadu Amon batii kɔmɛ. <verse eid="JOS 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 13:11" />Gilead, Gesur batii ku Maakat batii kasɔ kafɔɔ nsi kaamɛ, ku Hermon Kobokote kumuu ku Basan omuu diɛlaadu bia Salka- <verse eid="JOS 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 13:12" />ninle ni Og sɛka kalekɔ kamuu di Basan, niale ni sɛka di Astarot ku Edrei, nnwɔɔ niabu fɛle Refait batii nwu onwii lɛma yɛntɛle nɛ. Mose lalenkee ma ni aayɔ kasɔ lɛma nwu nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 13:13" />Kafɔɔ Israel batii ditatososa Geshur ku Maakat batii, nioso beekple basi di Israel batii kamɛ diɛbadu miɛ dii le mmle.<verse eid="JOS 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 13:14" />Kafɔɔ atata Lewi kɔna nwu atesaa, diekye asaaɔta ya bɛɛta ni SAATE, Israel Yaa nwu ku ɔtɔ nle atesaa lɛma, fɛ mmle aabuɛ aatɛ nii.<verse eid="JOS 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kasɔ Ka Baata Ni Ruben Kɔna</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 13:15" />Nnya kasɔ ka di Mose lata ni Ruben kɔna, di kafaabi, kafaabi kanya:<verse eid="JOS 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 13:16" />Kasɔ ka niedie ni di Aroer di Arnon Kɔwɛ kotoko, kɛɛyɔ ni kafɔɔ di okpoo wɔ di kɔwɛ nwu ntɛɛtɛɛ, ku Medeba ɔtaata omuu <verse eid="JOS 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 13:17" />kɛɛlaadu Hesbon ku sekpoo se simuu di ɔtaata nwu, di Dibon ku Bamot Baal ku Bet Baal Meon, <verse eid="JOS 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 13:18" />Yahas, Kedemot, Mefaat, <verse eid="JOS 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 13:19" />Kiriataim, Sibma ku Seret Sahar di lekpenkpe di ɔtaata nwu kamɛ, <verse eid="JOS 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 13:20" />ku Bet Peor dile ni Pisga lɛyɔnsa nwu ku Bet Yesimot, <verse eid="JOS 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 13:21" />sekpoo nwu simuu di ɔtaata nwu ku Amori batii ɔka Sihon sɛka kalekɔ kamuu, nnwɔ niale ni sɛka di Hesbon. Mose lalenkee nwɔ ku Midian batii baka biibii ba ninle ni Ewi, Rekem, Sur, Hur ku Reba- baka nwu labla onwii ku Sihon- wɔ niasiɛ ni di kale nwu. <verse eid="JOS 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 13:22" />Diakyaakaa ni di mba baalo ni di kakpɛ kamɛ yi, Israel batii lalo Beor obisuɔtɔbi Bileam wɔ niale ni bɔmpɛtɛ ku kapamii. <verse eid="JOS 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 13:23" />Ruben batii kɔmɛ niale Yordan Okle kotoko. Sekpoo se mmle ku sekpooenyii lɛma niale Ruben batii atesaa di kafaabi, kafaabi kanya nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 13:24" />Nnya kasɔ ka di Mose lata ni Gad kɔna, di kafaabi, kafaabi kanya:<verse eid="JOS 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 13:25" />Yaser kasɔ ku Gilead sekpoo simuu ku Amon batii kale-kakyɛ dialaadu ni bia Aroer, ninkaako ni Raba; <verse eid="JOS 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 13:26" />diayɔ kafɔɔ di Hesbon dialaadu Ramat Mispa ku Betonim, diadie kafɔɔ di Mahanaim dialaadu Debir kasɔ; <verse eid="JOS 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 13:27" />di ɔtaata nwu kamɛ, Bet Haram, Bet Nimra, Sukot, Safon ku Hesbon ɔka Sihon sɛka kalekɔ bule (Yordan kufĩ katunkɔ lɛkyɛ, kasɔ ka ninte kɛɛlaadu ni Kineret Lekpo kayɛntɛkɔ). <verse eid="JOS 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 13:28" />Sekpoo se mmle ku sekpooenyii lɛma niale Gad batii atesaa di kafaabi, kafaabi kanya nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 13:29" />Nnya kasɔ ka di Mose lata ni Manase kɔna-kakyɛ, ninle ni Manase banantii leyo kamɛ kakyɛ, di kafaabi, kafaabi kanya:<verse eid="JOS 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 13:30" />Kasɔ nwu niedie ni di Mahanaim di Basan omuu nsi ni kaamɛ, Basan ɔka Og sɛka kalekɔ kamuu- Yair nsiɛkɔ mmuu di Basan, sekpoo afosi-akuɔ, <verse eid="JOS 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 13:31" />Gilead kakyɛ ku Astarot ku Edrei (Og ɔka sekpoo kplɛ di Basan). Nka mmle niale Manase obisuɔtɔbi Makir banantii kale nɛ- kale ni Makir babisuɔtɔbi kakyɛ kasɔ di kafaabi, kafaabi kanya nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 13:32" />Nle mmle ninle atesaa ya di Mose lata ni di obe wɔ aawɛ ni di Moab sɛtaata diafe ni di Yordan di Yeriko kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 13:33" />Kafɔɔ Mose ditata Lewi kɔna atesaa kuanwii; SAATE, Israel Yaa ninle atesaa lɛma fɛ mmle aabuɛ aatɛ ma nii.<verse eid="JOS 13:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOS 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yordan Kufĩ Kamɛɛkɔ Kasɔ Ɔsɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 14:1" />Nnya aba ya di Israel batii lafũ ni fɛ atesaa di Kanaan kasɔ, di oletatɛ Eleaser ku Nun obisuɔtɔbi Yosua ku Israel ana nfaabi banɔɔfo lasɛ bata ma ni. <verse eid="JOS 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 14:2" />Atrebi baawii baasɛ atesaa lɛma nwu baata ana nwu anaasĩ-ku-kakyɛ, fɛ mmle di SAATE nwu labuɛ aafenko ni di Mose suoto. <verse eid="JOS 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 14:3" />Mose lata ana nwu anyɔ-ku-kakyɛ atesaa lɛma di Yordan kufĩ katunkɔ, kafɔɔ atata Lewi batii atesaa di babule kamɛ. <verse eid="JOS 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 14:4" />Diekye Yosef babisuɔtɔbi labla ana anyɔ- Manase ku Efraim. Lewi batii ditafũ kasɔ nwu kalekɔ kukanwii, kafɔɔ sekpoo se kamɛ baasiɛ ni lete ku babɔkɛɛ sele ku banankyue lɛma sɛfa kaweekɔ nsɔ. <verse eid="JOS 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 14:5" />Nioso Israel batii lasɛ kasɔ nwu, fɛ mmle kanya di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ ni Mose.<verse eid="JOS 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baayɔ Hebron Baata Kaleb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 14:6" />Ninfɛ di Yuda batii lawa Yosua ɔkyɛ di Gilgal, ni di Yefune, Kenisi otii nwu obisuɔtɔbi Kaleb latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Faye ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ ni Mose, Yaa otii nwu di Kades Barnea di ami ku afɔ suoto. <verse eid="JOS 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 14:7" />Alɛɛ afosi-ana lafũ fiɛ di SAATE nwu kpɛmblatɛ Mose lakpee mi lekyɛ Kedes Barnea alɛ nnaanyunyu kasɔ nwu. Ni lakple lawa labatɔkɔ nwɔ mmle kanya lanya ni nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 14:8" />Kafɔɔ babiloo ba ku ami niakata buakyɛ ni lata batii nwu situ lakpa ku lɛyɛkɛ. Kafɔɔ, ami, latikanko SAATE, Yaa nii nwu ku otu nii omuu. <verse eid="JOS 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 14:9" />Nioso di dii nwu nkpo Mose laka ntam aatɛɛ alɛ, ‘Kasɔ ka di nkpaa lɛfɔ ntɔɔnafu ni kamale atesaa lɛfɔ ku babi lɛfɔ ale dinaa ni kaloo, diekye feetikanko SAATE, Yaa nii nwu ku otu omuu.’<verse eid="JOS 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 14:10" />“Nioso nunua, fɛ mmle di SAATE nwu laka ni ntam, atooklee nkpa nii alɛɛ afosi-ana-anɔɔ, diayɔ ni di obe nwu aabuɛ ni ɔlaa wɔ mmle aatɔkɔ ni Mose, di obe wɔ di Israel batii lakyɛ baatookyi ni di ɔfaafuu kamɛ. Nioso nnyɛɛ ninfũ miɛ, ntoofũ alɛɛ afosi-anɛ-anɔɔ! <verse eid="JOS 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 14:11" />Miɛ lekple nkpe osie fɛ dii le di Mose lakpee mi ni kɔtɔ; nkpe osie kadie nkyɛ ni kakpɛ nunua fɛ mmle late ni di obe nwu kamɛ. <verse eid="JOS 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 14:12" />Nioso nunua yɔ lekpenkpe kale ka mmle di SAATE nwu labuɛ aatɛ ni di dii nwu nkpo fatɛɛ. Afɔ omu faanu falɛ Anak batii lawɛ ninfa, sekpoo lɛma nwu lamuɔ baatofo seyoyiɛ kafɔɔ baakyisa, kafɔɔ, SAATE nwu kamakyakaakoe ntososa ma ndiki fɛ mmle aabuɛ nii.”<verse eid="JOS 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 14:13" />Ninfɛ di Yosua lata lɛtɔtrɔ Yefune obisuɔtɔbi Kaleb nɛ, ni aayɔ Hebron kasɔ aatɔɔ fɛ atesaa nɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 14:14" />Nioso Hebron lekple Yefune, Kenisi otii nwu obisuɔtɔbi Kaleb atesaa diɛbadu miɛ. Diekye aatikanko SAATE, Israel batii Yaa nwu ku otu omuu. <verse eid="JOS 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 14:15" />(Saa yi, Arba leyooto baatika Hebron alɛ Kiriat Arba. Arba lale osuɔtɔ wɔ niatɛ aafũ ni leyooto aalenkee ni di Anak batii kamɛ.)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 14:15">Ninfɛ di kasɔ nwu latɛ ɔnyɛɛ di kakpɛ suoto nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 14:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOS 15" />
  <para style="s1">Kasɔ Ka Baata Ni Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 15:1" />Kasɔ ka baata ni Yuda kɔna di kafaabi, kafaabi kanya lasoo kaalaadu Edom, kaalaadu Sin Ɔfaafuu di kala-kasɔ kayɛntɛkɔ.<verse eid="JOS 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 15:2" />Kala-kasɔ kɔmɛ lɛma lakye kasɔ di lɛpanta di Mmba Lekpo kala-kasɔ kayɛntɛkɔ, <verse eid="JOS 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 15:3" />kuawaalɛ Akrabim Kobokote kuakple kualaadu Sin kuafe kualaadu Kades Barnea kala-kasɔ. Ninfɛ kuamunikĩi kuafe di Hesron kuakata kualaadu Adar ni kuakɛ kuakyi kualaadu Karka. <verse eid="JOS 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 15:4" />Ninfɛ kuafe kualaadu Asmon, kualaabuo di Egipte Kaklenyii, kualaayɛntɛ di Lekpo. Nkũ ninle kala-kasɔ kɔmɛ lɛma nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 15:5" />Kufĩ katunkɔ kɔmɛ ninle Mmba Lekpo kuɔlaadu bia nfũ di Yordan okle lekpee ni kanya di Lekpo.</para>
  <para style="pi1" vid="JOS 15:5">Katoo-kasɔ kɔmɛ lakye kasɔ di lekpo lɛpanta di nfũ di Yordan lekpee ni kanya di lekpo, <verse eid="JOS 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 15:6" />kuakata kualaadu Bet Hogla, ni kuakple kuafe di Bet Araba katoo-kasɔ kualaadu Ruben obisuɔtɔbi Bohan Difuɔ katũ nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 15:7" />Kɔmɛ nwu nfɛ lakye di Akor Ɔtaata, kuakata kualaadu Debir, kuamunikĩi kuafe katoo-kasɔ kualaadu Gilgal wɔ niɛkyɔɔ ni anu Adumim Kobokote kɔwɛ kala-kasɔ. Kuakple kuafe kuabadu En Semes ntu katũ, ni kuabadie di En Rogel nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 15:8" />Ninfɛ di kɔmɛ nwu lakata Ben Hinom Ɔtaata kuafe di Yebusi batii okpoo kplɛ kala-kasɔ kobokote lɛyɔnsa (nnwu ninle Yerusalem nɛ). Kɔmɛ nwu ladie ninfa kuakata kualaadu Hinom Ɔtaata kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ lekpenkpe nsintɛɛ di Refaim Ɔtaata katoo-kasɔ kayɛntɛkɔ. <verse eid="JOS 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 15:9" />Kɔmɛ nwu ladie di lekpenkpe nsintɛɛ kuakyɔɔ anu di Neftoa ntu kataakɔ, kuabadie di Efron Kobokote sekpoo nwu kuasoo kuasifi Baala (nfa ninle Kiriat Yearim nɛ). <verse eid="JOS 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 15:10" />Ninfɛ di kɔmɛ nwu lakɛ kuakye Baala kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ lɛkyɛ kuafe Seir Kobokote, kuafe di Yearim Kobokote katoo-kasɔ lɛyɔnsa (nkũ ninle Kesalon nɛ), kuakple kuasoo kualaadu Bet Semes kuawaalɛ kualaadu Timna. <verse eid="JOS 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 15:11" />Kɔmɛ nwu lafe di Ekron katoo-kasɔ lɛyɔnsa, kuamunikĩi kuakyɔɔ anu Sikeron, kuafe di Baala Kobokote ɔlɔɔkɔ kualaadu kafɔɔ Yabneel. Kɔmɛ nwu layɛntɛ di lekpo.<verse eid="JOS 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 15:12" />Kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ kɔmɛ ninle Lekpo Kplɛ lekpo kotoko nɛ.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JOS 15:12">N-ya mmle ninle amɛ ya niɛmana ni Yuda batii eekyi ni di nfaabi lɛma kanya nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kaleb Lalenkee Hebron Ku Debir</para>
  <para style="r">(Batunletɛ 1.11–15)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 15:13" />Di SAATE nwu ɔlaa wɔ aatɔkɔ nwɔ ni kanya, Yosua lata Yefune obisuɔtɔbi Kaleb kalekɔ di Yuda-Kiriat Arba, ninle ni Hebron. (Anak waawa niale Arba.) <verse eid="JOS 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 15:14" />Di Hebron yi, Kaleb latososa Anak batii batiɛ nwu- Sesai, Ahiman ku Talmai- Anak banantii. <verse eid="JOS 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 15:15" />Nfa di Kaleb ladie aakyɛ aalaakpɛko batii ba niasiɛ ni di Debir (saa baatɔɔlɛɛ nwu Kiriat Sefer). <verse eid="JOS 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 15:16" />Ni di Kaleb labuɛ alɛ, “Osuɔtɔ wɔ nimakpɛko ni Kiriat Sefer anfũ nwu nii yi, kamayɔ obisankobi nii Aksa ntɔɔ an-yɔ.” <verse eid="JOS 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 15:17" />Kaleb obilɛma-suɔtɔbi Kenas obisuɔtɔbi Otniel nialenkee nwu; nioso Kaleb layɔ obisankobi nɔɔ Aksa aatɔɔ aayɔ.<verse eid="JOS 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 15:18" />Dii ninwii, di ɔsanko nwu lakyɛ ni Otniel nfũ yi, ni aatɔkɔ Otniel alɛ akaalɛ ote Kaleb aatɔɔ kofe. Obe wɔ di Kaleb obisankobi nɔɔ lasoo ni di bɔkɛɛ nɔɔ wɔ nintuka ni atoo suoto, Kaleb lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Obe nimbla nta fɔ?”<verse eid="JOS 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 15:19" />Ni aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Le mi sibualɛ finle. Fatɔɔtɛɛ ni kasɔ di Kalakasɔ lɛkyɛ yi, tɛɛ kafɔɔ ntu ntaakɔ.” Nioso Kaleb latɔɔ osi ku kalɔ ntu ntaakɔ.<verse eid="JOS 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sekpoo Se Baata Ni Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 15:20" />Nnya Yuda kɔna atesaa di kafaabi, kafaabi kanya:<verse eid="JOS 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 15:21" />Yuda kɔna kala-kasɔ kala sekpoo di Kalakasɔ diofe ni Edom kɔmɛ niale:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="JOS 15:21">Kabseel, Eder, Yager, <verse eid="JOS 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 15:22" />Kina, Dimona, Adada, <verse eid="JOS 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 15:23" />Kedes, Hasor, Itnan, <verse eid="JOS 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 15:24" />Sif, Telem, Bealot, <verse eid="JOS 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 15:25" />Hasor Hadata, Keriot Hesron, (ninle ni Hasor), <verse eid="JOS 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 15:26" />Amam, Sema, Molada, <verse eid="JOS 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 15:27" />Hasar Gada, Hesmon, Bet Pelet, <verse eid="JOS 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 15:28" />Hasar Sual, Beerseba, Bisiotia, <verse eid="JOS 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 15:29" />Baala, Iyim, Esem, <verse eid="JOS 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 15:30" />Eltolad, Kesil, Horma, <verse eid="JOS 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 15:31" />Siklag, Madmana, Sansana, <verse eid="JOS 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 15:32" />Lebaot, Silhim, Ain ku Rimon- diabla ekpoo afosi-anyɔ ɛnaasĩ ku sekpooenyii lɛma.<verse eid="JOS 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 15:33" />Di kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ akpenkpe nkpaa:</para>
  <para style="pi1" vid="JOS 15:33">Estaol, Sora, Asna, <verse eid="JOS 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 15:34" />Sanoa, En Ganim, Tapua, Enam, <verse eid="JOS 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 15:35" />Yarmut, Adulam, Soko ku Aseka, <verse eid="JOS 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 15:36" />Saaraim ku Aditaim ku Gedera (ee Gederotaim)- lefosi ekpoo ɛna ku sekpooenyii lɛma.<verse eid="JOS 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 15:37" />Senan, Hadasa ku Migdal Gad, <verse eid="JOS 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 15:38" />Dilean, Mispa, Yokteel, <verse eid="JOS 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 15:39" />Lakis, Boskat, Eglon, <verse eid="JOS 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 15:40" />Kabon, Lahmas, Kitlis, <verse eid="JOS 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 15:41" />Gederot Bet Dagon, Naama ku Makeda- lefosi ekpoo ɛkuɔ ku sekpooenyii lɛma.<verse eid="JOS 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 15:42" />Libna, Eter, Asan, <verse eid="JOS 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 15:43" />Yifta, Asna, Nesib, <verse eid="JOS 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 15:44" />Keila, Aksib ku Maresa- ekpoo ɛnaasĩ ku sekpooenyii lɛma.<verse eid="JOS 15:44" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 15:45" />Ekron ku nsiɛkɔ nɔɔ be niɛmana nwu diekyi ni ku sekpooenyii nɔɔ; <verse eid="JOS 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JOS 15:46" />di Ekron kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ ku sekpoo se simuu niawɛ ni di Asdod obo nwu ku sekpooenyii lɛma; <verse eid="JOS 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JOS 15:47" />Asdod ku nsiɛkɔ ku sekpooenyii se niɛmana nwu siekyi ni; ku Gasa nsiɛkɔ ku sekpooenyii nɔɔ, kualaadu bia Egipte Kalenyii ku Lekpo Kplɛ kotoko.<verse eid="JOS 15:47" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JOS 15:48" />Di akpenkpe kale yi:</para>
  <para style="pi1" vid="JOS 15:48">Samir, Yatir, Soko, <verse eid="JOS 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JOS 15:49" />Dana, Kiriat Sana (ninle ni Debir), <verse eid="JOS 15:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JOS 15:50" />Anab, Estemo, Anim, <verse eid="JOS 15:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JOS 15:51" />Gosen, Holon ku Gilo- lefosi okpoo onwii ku sekpooenyii lɛma.<verse eid="JOS 15:51" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JOS 15:52" />Arab, Duma, Esan, <verse eid="JOS 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JOS 15:53" />Yanim, Bet Tapua, Afeka, <verse eid="JOS 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JOS 15:54" />Humta, Kiriat Arba (ninle ni Hebron) ku Sior-ekpoo ɛnaasĩ ku sɛkpoonyii lɛma.<verse eid="JOS 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JOS 15:55" />Maon, Karmel, Sif, Yuta, <verse eid="JOS 15:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JOS 15:56" />Yesreel, Yokdeam, Sanoa, <verse eid="JOS 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JOS 15:57" />Kain, Gibea ku Timna- ekpoo lefosi ku sekpooenyii lɛma.<verse eid="JOS 15:57" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JOS 15:58" />Halhul, Bet Sur, Gedor, <verse eid="JOS 15:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JOS 15:59" />Maarat, Bet Anot ku Eltekon- ekpoo ekuɔ ku sekpooenyii lɛma.<verse eid="JOS 15:59" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JOS 15:60" />Kiriat Baal (ninle ni Kiriat Yearim) ku Raba- ekpoo ɛnyɔ ku sekpooenyii lɛma.<verse eid="JOS 15:60" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JOS 15:61" />Di ɔfaafuu:</para>
  <para style="pi1" vid="JOS 15:61">Bet Araba, Midin, Sekaka, <verse eid="JOS 15:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JOS 15:62" />Nibsan, Mmba Okpoo Kplɛ nwu ku En Gedi- ekpoo ekuɔ ku sekpooenyii lɛma.<verse eid="JOS 15:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="JOS 15:63" />Yuda ditafuo Yebusi batii ba niasiɛ ni di Yerusalem otososa; Yebusi batii nsi ninfa ku Yuda batii diɛbase miɛ wɔ mmle.<verse eid="JOS 15:63" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOS 16" />
  <para style="s1">Kasɔ Ka Baata Ni Efraim Ku Manase Di Kufĩ Kamɛɛkɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 16:1" />Kasɔ ka baata ni Yosef lakye kasɔ di Yordan di Yeriko ɔlɔɔkɔ, di Yeriko okle kufĩ katunkɔ, kaakata ninfa kaafe di ɔfaafuu kaabuo di Betel kale lekpenkpe nwu. <verse eid="JOS 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 16:2" />Kaakple kaadie di Betel (ninle ni Lus), kaataale kaafe di Arki batii kasɔ di Atarot, <verse eid="JOS 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 16:3" />kaasoo di kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ lɛkyɛ kaafe di Yaflet batii kasɔ kaalaadu bia Kala Bet Horon kasɔ kaafe kafɔɔ kaalaadu Geser, kaayɛntɛ di lekpo.<verse eid="JOS 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 16:4" />Nioso Yosef banantii, Manase ku Efraim lafũ atesaa lɛma.<verse eid="JOS 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 16:5" />Nnya nka mmle niale ni Efraim kasɔ di kafaabi, kafaabi kanya:</para>
  <para style="pi1" vid="JOS 16:5">Atesaa lɛma kɔmɛ ladie di Atarot Adar di kufĩ katunkɔ kualaadu Katoo Bet Horon <verse eid="JOS 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 16:6" />kuakple kualaadu lekpo. Kɔmɛ nwu ladie di Mikmetat di katoo-kasɔ, kuakɛ di kufĩ katunkɔ lɛkyɛ kuasifi Tanat Silo, kuafe ninwu ɔlɔɔkɔ kuasifi Yanoa di kufĩ katunkɔ. <verse eid="JOS 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 16:7" />Ninfɛ kuasoo kuakye Yanoa kuasifi Atarot ku Naara, kuakaa di Yeriko, ni kuabadie di Yordan nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 16:8" />Kɔmɛ nwu ladie di Tapua kuafe di kufĩ-kamɛɛkɔ kuasifi Kana Kɔwɛ, ni kualaayɛntɛ di lekpo nɛ. Nka mmle niale Efraim batii kɔna atesaa di kafaabi, kafaabi kanya nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 16:9" />Sekpoo ku sekpooenyii lɛma simuu se baadiki baatɛ baata ni Efraim batii di Manase batii atesaa kamɛ kafɔɔ lasiɛ kaamɛ.<verse eid="JOS 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 16:10" />Kafɔɔ Efraim batii ditatososa Kanaan batii ba ninsi ni di Geser; diɛbase bia miɛ wɔ mmle, Kanaan batii nsi bakpɔtɔɔ di Efraim batii kamɛ. Kafɔɔ Efraim batii konyinka ma mambla sɛkpɛ siene.<verse eid="JOS 16:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOS 17" />
  <para style="s1">Manase Di Kufĩ Kamɛɛkɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 17:1" />Nnya kasɔ ka baata ni Manase kɔna fɛ Yosef dibite, ninle ni Makir, Manase dibite kale. Makir niale Gilead batii waawa, nnwɔ niafũ ni Gilead ku Basan, ta Makir batii lale ni bakpɛtɛ siene oso. <verse eid="JOS 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 17:2" />Nioso kasɔ ka mmle lale Manase batii bule kale- Abieser, Helek, Asriel, Sekem, Hefer ku Semida nfaabi. Mba mmle ninle Yosef obisuɔtɔbi Manase banantii-suɔtɔ bamba di nfaabi lɛma kanya nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 17:3" />Ninfɛ di Manase obisuɔtɔbi Makir, obisuɔtɔbi Gilead, obisuɔtɔbi Hefer, obisuɔtɔbi Selofehad ditawɛ babisuɔtɔbi nɛ, kafɔɔ babisankobi lete. Ayooto lɛma niale, Mahla, Noa, Hogla, Milka ku Tirsa nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 17:4" />Baakyɛ oletatɛ Eleasar ku Nun obisuɔtɔbi Yosua ku batunletɛ nwu ɔkyɛ alɛ, “SAATE nwu latɔkɔ Mose alɛ ata wo atesaa di babiloo-suɔtɔbi kamɛ.” Nioso Yosua lata ma atesaa ku ote lɛma babilɛma-suɔtɔbi, di SAATE nwu ɔlaa kanya. <verse eid="JOS 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 17:5" />Manase kasɔ lale nlekɔ lefosi di Gilead ku Banan ɔlɔɔkɔ di Yordan kufĩ-katunkɔ. <verse eid="JOS 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 17:6" />Diekye Manase kɔna babisankobi lafũ atesaa di babisuɔtɔbi kamɛ. Gilead kasɔ nwu nle Manase banantii yɛntɛle kale.<verse eid="JOS 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 17:7" />Manase kasɔ ladie di Aser kalaadu Mikmetat di Sekem kufĩ-katunkɔ. Kɔmɛ nwu lafe di kala-kasɔ lɛkyɛ, kuayɔ ninfa kuakpa batii ba ninsi ni di En Tapua kuakpee kaamɛ. <verse eid="JOS 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 17:8" />(Tapua kasɔ nwu nle Manase kale, kafɔɔ Tapua okpoo omu di Manase kɔmɛ nwu suoto nle Efraim batii ole.) <verse eid="JOS 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 17:9" />Ninfɛ di kɔmɛ nwu lakple kuafe di kala-kasɔ kualaadu Kana Kɔwɛ. Sekpoo se ninle ni Efraim sele nte sikpɔtɔɔ di Manase sekpoo kamɛ, kafɔɔ Manase kɔmɛ niale kɔwɛ nwu katoo-kasɔ lɛkyɛ, kualaayɛntɛ di lekpo. <verse eid="JOS 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 17:10" />Kasɔ nwu di kala-kasɔ nle Efraim kale, nka di katoo-kasɔ nle Manase kale. Manase kasɔ ladu lekpo, ate kɔmɛ ku Aser di katoo-kasɔ, kufĩ-katunkɔ kafɔɔ ku Isakar.<verse eid="JOS 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 17:11" />Di Isakar ku Aser nwu kamɛ yi, Manase kafɔɔ lawɛ Bat San, Yibleam, Dor, Endor, Taanak ku Megido batii, mma ku nsiɛkɔ lɛma be niɛmana ma diekyi ni (otiɛfa kaamɛ ninle Nafot).<verse eid="JOS 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 17:12" />Kafɔɔ Manase batii ditafuo sekpoo se mmle ofũ, diekye Kanaan batii latɛ alɛ boosiɛ di kasɔ nwu. <verse eid="JOS 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 17:13" />Kafɔɔ, obe wɔ di Israel batii lawɛ osie baakyakaa nii, baanyinka Kanaan batii baabla sɛkpɛ siene, kafɔɔ batatososa ma baadiki klekle.<verse eid="JOS 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Efraim Ku Manaase Di Kufĩ Kamɛɛkɔ Lakaalɛ Kasɔ Baakyakaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 17:14" />Yosef batii latɔkɔ Yosua alɛ, “Obe oso di kasɔ lɛba ninwii ku kalekɔ kanwii lete fɛɛta falɛ kale wo atesaa? Batii ba nimpɔ ni bule, SAATE nwu kafɔɔ lɛta wo lɛtɔtrɔ osie kanya.”<verse eid="JOS 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 17:15" />Ninfɛ di Yosua ladiki kanya alɛ, “Nse bipɔ, di Efraim lekpenkpe kale lesii ye obiibii yi, ni bikata bikyɛ biɛlaakpɛ lepoo nwu ninfa bita suoto lee di Perisi batii ku Refait batii kasɔ nwu.”<verse eid="JOS 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 17:16" />Ninfɛ di Yosef batii latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Lekpenkpe kasɔ nwu diɛpɔ wo, Kanaan batii ba kafɔɔ ninsi ni di ɔtaata nwu nkpe abɔɔsaa bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni, manko mba di Bet Sean ku nsiɛkɔ be ninwu ku mba di Yesreel Ɔtaata.”<verse eid="JOS 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 17:17" />Kafɔɔ Yosua latɔkɔ Yosef leyo batii- Efraim ku Manase alɛ, “Bipɔ, biɛtɛ bikpe osie kafɔɔ. Bilɔbawɛ kasɔ lɛba ninwii lete, <verse eid="JOS 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 17:18" />kafɔɔ ku lekpenkpe kale lepoo. Bikpɛ ni, ni kasekɔ ninka di lɛkaana kamɛ kamale ye kale; kuntɛ Kanaan batii nwu nkpe abɔɔsaa bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni, kuntɛ bakpe osie kafɔɔ yi, bibafuo ma otososa odiki.”<verse eid="JOS 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOS 18" />
  <para style="s1">Kasɔ Nwu Bule Ɔsɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 18:1" />Ninfɛ di Israel batii dikudi nimuu lasi di Silo, ni baapɛ Lɛkpaayo le Mansi ni ninfa nɛ. Baalenkee kale nwu di anu lɛma, <verse eid="JOS 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 18:2" />kafɔɔ Israel batii ana akuɛnsĩ lakple aabu anadifũ ni atesaa lɛma.<verse eid="JOS 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 18:3" />Nioso Yosua lakaalɛ Israel batii nwu alɛ: “Ɔmɛmbe bibasiɛ minaase fiɛ bibalaayɔ kasɔ ka di SAATE nwu, bate lee Yaa nwu lɛta ye ni? <verse eid="JOS 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 18:4" />Bidiki basuɔtɔ batiɛ, batiɛ di kɔna biala kamɛ bitɛɛ. Kamakpee ma manaanyu kasɔ nwu, mankpana letembi lɛka di obiala atesaa kanya. Fiɛ nfɛ babakple manwa ɔkyɛ nii. <verse eid="JOS 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 18:5" />Dikpeni biɛsɛ kasɔ nwu di akyuu akuɛnsĩ. Yuda asiɛ osiɛ di kasɔ nɔɔ suoto di kala-kasɔ nwu, di Yosef leyo kafɔɔ asiɛ di kasɔ nɔɔ suoto di katoo-kasɔ nwu. <verse eid="JOS 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 18:6" />Nse bitɔɔkpana kasɔ akyuu akuɛnsĩ nwu letembi bieloo, biɛyɔ nya biwakoe ninfũ. Kamawii atrebi nta ye di SAATE Yaa loo anu. <verse eid="JOS 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 18:7" />Lewi batii ditawɛ kalekɔ di kamɛ lee, diekye SAATE nwu oleɔta ɔsaabla nwu ninle atesaa lɛma. Gad, Ruben ku Manase kɔna-kakyɛ kanwii kafɔɔ ntoofũ atesaa lɛma kofokofoko di Yordan kufĩ katunkɔ lɛkyɛ. SAATE nwu kpɛmblatɛ Mose niayɔ ka aata ma.”<verse eid="JOS 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 18:8" />Di basuɔtɔ nwu layefe ni osuku alɛ bɔɔlaatɛ ni kasɔ nwu nsũ yi, ni di Yosua latɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Bidie bikyɛ biɛlaanyu kasɔ nwu, biɛkpana letembi lɛka. Nni sɛmaa biekple biwa ɔkyɛ nii. Kamawii atrebi nta ye ninfũ, di Silo di SAATE nwu anu.” <verse eid="JOS 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 18:9" />Nioso basuɔtɔ nwu lasifi baalaafenfe di kasɔ nwu. Baakpana letembi lɛka di kukũ suoto, okpoo, okpoo di akyuu akuɛnsĩ, ni baakple baawa Yosua nfũ di kasiɛkɔ nwu di Silo nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 18:10" />Ninfɛ di Yosua lawii atrebi aata ma di Silo di SAATE nwu anu, nfa kafɔɔ aasɛ kasɔ nwu aata Israel batii di ana lɛma letembi kanya nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kasɔ Ka Baata Ni Benyamin</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 18:11" />Atrebi owii nwu latika di Benyamin kɔna, di kafaabi, kafaabi kanya. Kasɔ ka baata ma ni nte di Yuda ku Yosef ana obo:<verse eid="JOS 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 18:12" />Di katoo-kasɔ lɛkyɛ yi, kɔmɛ lɛma lakye kasɔ di Yordan, kuafe di Yeriko lɛyɔnsa katoo-kasɔ, ni kuakyɔɔ lekpenkpe kale kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ anu, kuabadie di Bet Awen ɔfaafuu nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 18:13" />Kɔmɛ nwu ladie ninfa kuawaalɛ kualaadu Lus kala-kasɔ lɛyɔnsa (nfa ninle Betel nɛ), kuasoo kuasifi Atarot Adar di Kala Bet Horon kala-kasɔ lɛkpenkpe suoto.<verse eid="JOS 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 18:14" />Kɔmɛ nwu ladie di lekpenkpe le niɛkyɔɔ ni Bet Horon anu di kala-kasɔ, kuamunikĩi di kala-kasɔ kuafe kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ lɛkyɛ, ni kuabadie di Kiriat Baal (nfa ninle Kiriat Yearim nɛ), Yuda batii okpoo. Nkũ niale kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ lɛkyɛ kole nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 18:15" />Kala-kasɔ lɛkyɛ kɔmɛ lakye kasɔ di Kiriat Yearim kasũkunya di kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ. Ninfɛ di kɔmɛ nwu labadie di Neftoa ntu kataakɔ nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 18:16" />Kɔmɛ nwu lasoo kuasifi lekpenkpe le nkpaa niɛkyɔɔ ni Ben Hinom Ɔtaata anu di Refaim Ɔtaata katoo-kasɔ. Kuakple kuasoo di Hinom Ɔtaata kuafe di Yebusi batii okpoo kala-kasɔ lɛyɔnsa kualaadu En Rogel. <verse eid="JOS 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 18:17" />Kɔmɛ nwu lakɛ di katoo-kasɔ, kuafe di En Semes, kuakple kualaadu Gelilot wɔ niɛkyɔɔ ni Adumim Kobokote anu, ni kuasoo kualaadu Ruben obisuɔtɔbi Bohan Difuɔ katũ nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 18:18" />Kuakple kuafe di Bet Araba katoo-kasɔ lɛyɔnsa ni kuasoo kuabuo di Araba nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 18:19" />Ni kuafe di Bet Hogla katoo-kasɔ lɛyɔnsa kuabadie di Mmba lekpo lɛpanta katoo-kasɔ, di nfũ di Yordan lekpee ni kanya di lekpo di kala-kasɔ. Nkũ niale kala-kasɔ kɔmɛ nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 18:20" />Yordan niɛbla kɔmɛ di kufĩ-katunkɔ lɛkyɛ.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JOS 18:20">N-ya niale amɛ ya niatuo ni Benyamin nfaabi atesaa di nkyɛ nwu mmuu nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 18:21" />Benyamin kɔna di kafaabi, kafaabi kanya lawɛ sekpoo se mmle:</para>
  <para style="pi1" vid="JOS 18:21">Yeriko, Bet Hogla, Emek Kesis, <verse eid="JOS 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 18:22" />Bet Araba, Semaraim, Betel, <verse eid="JOS 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 18:23" />Awim, Para, Ofra, <verse eid="JOS 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 18:24" />Kefar, Amonai, Ofni ku Geba- ekpoo lefosi-ɛnyɔ ku sekpooenyii nɔɔ.<verse eid="JOS 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 18:25" />Gibeon, Rama, Beerot, <verse eid="JOS 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 18:26" />Mispa, Kefira, Mosa, <verse eid="JOS 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 18:27" />Rekem, Yirpeel, Tarala, <verse eid="JOS 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 18:28" />Sela, Haelef ku Yebusi okpoo (nwu ninle Yerusalem nɛ), Gibeat ku Kiriat- ekpoo lefosi-ɛna ku sekpooenyii nɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JOS 18:28">Nle mmle niale Benyamin atesaa ɛɛta ni nfaabi nɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOS 19" />
  <para style="s1">Kasɔ Ka Baata Ni Simeon</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 19:1" />Atrebi owii nwu nyɔɔfa lawa diata Simeon kɔna, di kafaabi, kafaabi kanya. Atesaa lɛma nte di Yuda kasɔ kamɛ. <verse eid="JOS 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 19:2" />Mba ninsi ni kaamɛ ninle:</para>
  <para style="pi1" vid="JOS 19:2">Beerseba (ee Siba), Molada, <verse eid="JOS 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 19:3" />Hasar Sual, Bala, Esem, <verse eid="JOS 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 19:4" />Eltolad, Betul, Horma, <verse eid="JOS 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 19:5" />Siklag, Bet Markabot, Hasar Susa, <verse eid="JOS 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 19:6" />Bet Lebaot ku Saruhen- ekpoo lefosi-etiɛ ku sekpooenyii lɛma.<verse eid="JOS 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 19:7" />Ain, Rimon, Eter ku Asan- ekpoo ɛna ku sekpooenyii lɛma- <verse eid="JOS 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 19:8" />ku sekpooenyii nwu emuu di ekpoo be mmle sɛlɔɔkɔ siɛlaadu ni Baalat Beer (Ramat di Kala-Kasɔ).</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JOS 19:8">Nle mmle niale Simeon batii kɔna atesaa di kafaabi, kafaabi kanya nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 19:9" />Baadiki Simeon batii atesaa nwu baakyeko Yuda ale kamɛ, diekye Yuda kalekɔ lapɔ kaalenkee nka boomiɛ nii. Nioso Simeon batii lafũ atesaa lɛma di Yuda kasɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="JOS 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kasɔ Ka Baata Ni Sebulon</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 19:10" />Atrebi owii nwu tiɛfa lawa diata Sebulon di kafaabi, kafaabi kanya:</para>
  <para style="pi1" vid="JOS 19:10">Atesaa lɛma kɔmɛ laladu bia Sarid. <verse eid="JOS 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 19:11" />Kuafe di kufĩ-kamɛɛkɔ kualaadu Marala, kuakaa di Dabeset, ni kualaadu kɔwɛ ko niɛtɛɛtɛɛ ni Yokneam nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 19:12" />Kɔmɛ nwu lamunikĩi kuadie di kufĩ-katunkɔ di Sarid kuakyɔɔ anu kufĩ-katunkɔ kuasifi Kislot Tabor kasɔ, kualaafe di Daberat kuakata kualaadu Yafia. <verse eid="JOS 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 19:13" />Ninfɛ kuakple kuafe di kufĩ-katunkɔ lɛkyɛ kuasifi Gat Hefer ku Et Kasin; kuabadie di Rimon kuakyɔɔ anu Nea. <verse eid="JOS 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 19:14" />Nfa di kɔmɛ nwu lakyɛ kuakyi di katoo-kasɔ nwu kuabadu Hanaton, ni kuayɛntɛ di Yifa El Ɔtaata nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 19:15" />Sekpoo se niakyakaa ni niale Katat, Nahalal, Simron, Yidala ku Betlehem. Siabla ekpoo lefosi-ɛnyɔ ku sekpooenyii lɛma.<verse eid="JOS 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 19:16" />Ekpoo ku sekpooenyii lɛma se mmle niale Sebulon atesaa di kafaabi, kafaabi kanya nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kasɔ Ka Baata Ni Isakar</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 19:17" />Atrebi owii nwu naafa lawa diata Isakar di kafaabi, kafaabi kanya. <verse eid="JOS 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 19:18" />Sekpoo se mmle nkyakaa di kasɔ lɛma kamɛ:</para>
  <para style="pi1" vid="JOS 19:18">Yesreel, Kesulot, Sunem, <verse eid="JOS 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 19:19" />Hafraim, Sihon, Anaharat, <verse eid="JOS 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 19:20" />Rabit, Kision, Abes, <verse eid="JOS 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 19:21" />Remet, En Ganim, En Hada ku Bet Pases. <verse eid="JOS 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 19:22" />Kɔmɛ nwu lakaa di Tabor, Sahasima ku Bet Semes, ni kuayɛntɛ di Yordan nɛ. Siabla ekpoo lefosi-ekuɔ ku sekpooenyii lɛma.<verse eid="JOS 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 19:23" />Ekpoo ku sekpooenyii lɛma se mmle niale Isakar kɔna atesaa di kafaabi, kafaabi kanya nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kasɔ Ka Baata Ni Aser</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 19:24" />Atrebi owii nwu nɔɔnle lawa diata Aser di kafaabi, kafaabi kanya. <verse eid="JOS 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 19:25" />Sekpoo se mmle nkyakaa di kasɔ lɛma kamɛ:</para>
  <para style="pi1" vid="JOS 19:25">Helkat, Hali, Beten, Aksaf, <verse eid="JOS 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 19:26" />Alamelek, Amad ku Misal. Di kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ, kɔmɛ nwu lakaa di Karmel ku Sihor Libnat. <verse eid="JOS 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 19:27" />Ninfɛ kuamunikĩi di kufĩ katunkɔ kuakyɔɔ Bet Dagon anu, kuakaa di Sebulon ku Yifta El Ɔtaata, kuafe katoo-kasɔ kualaadu Bet Emek ku Neiel, kuafe di Kabul di ɔmɛntukyɛ. <verse eid="JOS 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 19:28" />Kuasifi Ebron, Rehob, Hamon ku Kana kualaadie bia Sidon Kplɛ. <verse eid="JOS 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 19:29" />Kɔmɛ nwu nfɛ lakple nkpaamaa kuakyɔɔ anu Rama, kuafe kuasifi Tiro okpoo wɔ baatofo oyoyiɛ baakyisa ni, kuamunikĩi kuakyɔɔ anu Hosa, ni kuabadie di lekpo di Aksib kasɔ suoto nɛ, <verse eid="JOS 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 19:30" />Uma, Afek ku Rehob. Diabla ekpoo afosi-anyɔ-ɛnyɔ ku sekpooenyii lɛma.<verse eid="JOS 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 19:31" />Sekpoo ku sekpooenyii lɛma se mmle niale Aser kɔna atesaa di kafaabi, kafaabi kanya nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kasɔ Ka Baata Ni Naftali</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 19:32" />Atrebi owii nwu kuɔnle lawa diata Naftali di kafaabi, kafaabi kanya.<verse eid="JOS 19:32" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 19:33" />Kɔmɛ lɛma ladie di Helef ku kowoso kplɛ nwu Saanaim, kuafe di Adami Nekeb ku Yabneel kuasifi Lakum, kuayɛntɛ di Yordan. <verse eid="JOS 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 19:34" />Kɔmɛ nwu ladie di kufĩ-kamɛɛkɔ kuafe di Asnot Tabor kuabadie di Hukok. Kuakaa di Sebulon di kala-kasɔ, Aser di kufĩ-kamɛɛkɔ ku Yordan di kufĩ-katunkɔ. <verse eid="JOS 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 19:35" />Sekpoo se baatofo seyoyiɛ baakyisa ni niale, Sidim, Ser, Hamat, Rakat, Kineret, <verse eid="JOS 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 19:36" />Adama, Rama, Hasor, <verse eid="JOS 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 19:37" />Kedes, Edrei, En Hasor, <verse eid="JOS 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 19:38" />Yiron, Migdal El, Horem, Bet Anat ku Bet Semes. Diabla ekpoo lefosi-ɛnaasĩ ku sekpooenyii lɛma.<verse eid="JOS 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 19:39" />Ekpoo ku sekpooenyii lɛma se mmle niale Naftali kɔna atesaa di kafaabi, kafaabi kanya nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kasɔ Ka Baata Ni Dan</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 19:40" />Atrebi owii nwu kuɛnsinle lawa diata Dan kɔna di kafaabi, kafaabi kanya. <verse eid="JOS 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 19:41" />Sekpoo se mmle nkyakaa di kasɔ lɛma kamɛ:</para>
  <para style="pi1" vid="JOS 19:41">Sora, Estaol, Ir Semes, <verse eid="JOS 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 19:42" />Saalabin, Ayalon, Yitla, <verse eid="JOS 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 19:43" />Elon, Timna, Ekron, <verse eid="JOS 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 19:44" />Elteke, Gibeton, Baalat, <verse eid="JOS 19:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 19:45" />Yehud, Bene Berak, Gat Rimon, <verse eid="JOS 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JOS 19:46" />Me Yarkon ku Rakon ku lɛba le niɛkyɔɔ ni Yafo anu.<verse eid="JOS 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JOS 19:47" />(Kafɔɔ Dan batii lanya dibuo di kasɔ lɛma nwu ɔyɔ suoto, nioso baakata baakyɛ baalaakpɛko Lesem, baafũ nwu, baalo ma ku kapamii, baayɔ nwu baabla ole ma. Baasiɛ di Lesem, ni baatika nwu bawa lɛma leyooto alɛ Dan nɛ.)<verse eid="JOS 19:47" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JOS 19:48" />Ekpoo ku sekpooenyii lɛma se mmle niale Dan kɔna atesaa di kafaabi, kafaabi kanya nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 19:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kasɔ Nwu Yɛntɛle Ɔsɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JOS 19:49" />Obe wɔ baaloo ni kasɔ nwu ɔsɛ di nlekɔ nimi kanya, ni di Israel batii lata Nun obisuɔtɔbi Yosua atesaa di kamɛ lɛma, <verse eid="JOS 19:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JOS 19:50" />fɛ mmle di SAATE nwu labuɛ ni nɛ. Baatɔɔ okpoo wɔ aakaalɛ nii- Timnat Sera di Efraim kale lekpenkpe osi. Ni aabudi okpoo ninfa aasiɛ nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 19:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JOS 19:51" />Mmi ninle nsɔ be di oletatɛ Eleasar ku Nun obisuɔtɔbi Yosua ku nfaabi nwu ana banɔɔfo di Israel lawii atrebi baasɛ ni di Silo, di SAATE nwu anu di Lɛkpaayo le Mansi kayoko nɛ. Nioso baaloo kasɔ nwu ɔsɛ.<verse eid="JOS 19:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOS 20" />
  <para style="s1">Katanikokɔ Sekpoo Kplɛ Nwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 20:1" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ Yosua alɛ: <verse eid="JOS 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 20:2" />"Tɔkɔ Israel batii falɛ badiki katanikokɔ sekpoo nwu batɛ, fɛ mmle latɔkɔ ye lafenko ni di Mose suoto, <verse eid="JOS 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 20:3" />alɛ otii lele nielo otii di difua kamɛ, ninanle kafɔɔ ɔtɛ ɛɛtɛ yi, otii nwu katoso ansifi ta mmle aawɛ ni katĩtĩi di otii wɔ beelo ni asaa letɛ nɔɔ dilɔbalo nwɔ akyisa nii.<verse eid="JOS 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 20:4" />“Nse eetoso eesifi sekpoo se mmle onwii kamɛ yi, ayila di okpoo kplɛ nwu kasukunya, aayɔ ɔlaa nɔɔ atɛ di okpoo kplɛ nwu banɔɔfo anu. Ni baafũ nwɔ di okpoo kplɛ lɛma nwu, baatɔɔ lɛba asiɛ ku mma. <verse eid="JOS 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 20:5" />Nse otii wɔ eelo ni asaa letɛ leti nwɔ yi, batandiki nnwɔ niɛbla ni okpile nwu baata, diekye eelo owo nɔɔ nwu ninanle ɔtɛ ɛɛtɛ nii, ninanle ni osi asi nwɔ ni oso. <verse eid="JOS 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 20:6" />Asiɛ di okpoo kplɛ nwu dilaase di obe wɔ babakanko nwɔ ni di okpoo dudu nwu anu, ninaase ni kafɔɔ di obe wɔ di oletatɛ-nɔɔfo wɔ nikɔbla ni kasumu ɔsaabla di obe nwu kamɛ lekpi ni fiɛ. Ni aafuo okple osifi leyo nɔɔ nimu di okpoo wɔ aatoso aadie ni kamɛ.”<verse eid="JOS 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 20:7" />Nioso baadiki Kedes di Galilea di Naftali kale lekpenkpe osi ku Sekem di Efraim kale lekpenkpe osi ku Kiriat Arba (ninle ni Hebron) di Yuda kale lekpenkpe baatɛ. <verse eid="JOS 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 20:8" />Di Yordan kufĩ katunkɔ lɛkyɛ di Yeriko yi, baadiki Beser di ɔfaafuu di ɔtaata kamɛ di Ruben kɔna ku Ramot di Gilead di Gad kɔna kamɛ ku Golan di Basan di Manase kɔna kamɛ baatɛ. <verse eid="JOS 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 20:9" />Israel otii lele ee ɔfɔɔ lele ninsi ni kaamɛ lɛma nielo otii owo di difua kamɛ katoso ansifi sekpoo se mmle beediki bɛɛtɛ ni, alɛ otii wɔ eelo ni asaa letɛ nɔɔ dilaalo nwɔ alesa ni katũ fiɛ baakanko nwɔ ni di okpoo dudu anu.<verse eid="JOS 20:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOS 21" />
  <para style="s1">Lewi Batii Sekpoo Kplɛ Nwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 21:1" />Ninfɛ di Lewi batii ayo kamɛ banɔɔfo lakyɛ oletatɛ Eleasar ku Nun obisuɔtɔbi Yosua ku Israel ana bamba ayo kamɛ banɔɔfo ɔkyɛ <verse eid="JOS 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 21:2" />di Silo di Kanaan baalaatɔkɔ ma alɛ, “SAATE nwu labuɛ aafenko di Mose suoto alɛ bita wo sekpoo buosiɛ ku babɔkɛɛ sele loo sɛfa kaweekɔ.” <verse eid="JOS 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 21:3" />Nioso fɛ mmle di SAATE nwu labuɛ nii, Israel batii lata Lewi batii sekpoo se mmle ku sɛfa kaweekɔ di atesaa lɛma amu kamɛ:<verse eid="JOS 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 21:4" />Atrebi owii nwu kasale lawa diata Kohat batii di kafaabi, kafaabi kanya. Baata Lewi batii ba niale ni Aron banantii, olebatatɛ nwu, ekpoo lefosi-etiɛ di Yuda ku Simeon ku Benyamin ana kamɛ. <verse eid="JOS 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 21:5" />Baata Kohat batii banantii bule ekpoo lefosi di Efraim ku Dan ana ku Manase kɔna-kakyɛ di kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ nfaabi kasɔ.<verse eid="JOS 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 21:6" />Baata Gerson banantii ekpoo lefosi-etiɛ di Isakar, Aser, Naftali ana nfaabi ku Manase kɔna-kakyɛ nwu di kufĩ katunkɔ kafaabi di Basan.<verse eid="JOS 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 21:7" />Merari banantii lafũ ekpoo lefosi-ɛnyɔ di kafaabi, kafaabi kanya di Ruben ku Gad ku Sebulon ana ɔkyɛ.<verse eid="JOS 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 21:8" />Nioso Israel batii lata Lewi batii sekpoo se mmle ku sɛfa kaweekɔ, fɛ mmle di SAATE nwu labuɛ aafenko ni di Mose suoto.<verse eid="JOS 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 21:9" />Di Yuda ku Simeon ana kamɛ baayɔ sekpoo se mmle baata di ayooto kanya <verse eid="JOS 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 21:10" />(sekpoo se mmle baayɔ baata Aron banantii ba niakye ni Kohat batii nfaabi, baale ni Lewi batii, diekye atrebi owii nwu kasale lase di suoto lɛma):<verse eid="JOS 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 21:11" />Baayɔ Kiriat Arba (nnwu ninle Hebron nɛ), baata ma ku sɛfa kaweekɔ ka niɛmana sĩ siekyi nii, di Yuda kale lekpenkpe. (Arba niale Anak waawa nɛ.) <verse eid="JOS 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 21:12" />Kafɔɔ baayɔ afe ku sekpooenyii se di okpoo kplɛ nwu sɛlɔɔkɔ baata Yefune obisuɔtɔbi Kaleb fɛ kalekɔ nɔɔ.<verse eid="JOS 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 21:13" />Nioso baayɔ Hebron (katanikokɔ okpoo diɛta ni otii wɔ nielo ni otii) baata oletatɛ Aron banantii, Libna, <verse eid="JOS 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 21:14" />Yatir, Estemoa, <verse eid="JOS 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 21:15" />Holon, Debir, <verse eid="JOS 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 21:16" />Ain, Yuta ku Bet Semes, di babɔkɛɛ lɛma sɛfa nweekɔ nsɔ nkyakaa nii- ekpoo ɛnaasĩ niakye ana anyɔ ya mmle kamɛ.<verse eid="JOS 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 21:17" />Di Benyamin kɔna kamɛ, baayɔ Gibeon, Geba, <verse eid="JOS 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 21:18" />Anatot ku Almon, di babɔkɛɛ lɛma sɛfa nweekɔ nsɔ nkyakaa nii- ekpoo ɛna.<verse eid="JOS 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 21:19" />Sekpoo se simuu niale ni olebatatɛ, Aron banantii sele labla lefosi-etiɛ, di babɔkɛɛ lɛma sɛfa nweekɔ nsɔ nkyakaa nii.<verse eid="JOS 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 21:20" />Baata Kohat batii nfaabi be niale ni Lewi batii sekpoo di Efraim kɔna kamɛ:<verse eid="JOS 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 21:21" />Di Efriam lekpenkpe kale, baata ma Sekem (katanikokɔ okpoo diɛta ni otii wɔ nielo ni otii), Geser, <verse eid="JOS 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 21:22" />Kibsaim ku Bet Horon, di babɔkɛɛ lɛma sɛfa nweekɔ nsɔ nkyakaa nii- ekpoo ɛna.<verse eid="JOS 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 21:23" />Di Dan kɔna kafɔɔ kamɛ baafũ Elteke, Gibeton, <verse eid="JOS 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 21:24" />Ayalon ku Gat Rimon, di babɔkɛɛ lɛma sɛfa nweekɔ nsɔ nkyakaa nii- ekpoo ɛna.<verse eid="JOS 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 21:25" />Di Manase kɔna-kakyɛ nwu yi, baafũ Taanak ku Gat Rimon, di babɔkɛɛ lɛma sɛfa nweekɔ nsɔ nkyakaa nii- ekpoo ɛnyɔ.<verse eid="JOS 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 21:26" />Baayɔ ekpoo lefosi se mmle emuu ku babɔkɛɛ lɛma sɛfa nweekɔ nsɔ nwu baata Kohat batii nfaabi bule.<verse eid="JOS 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 21:27" />Baata Lewi batii nfaabi be niale ni Gerson batii:</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="JOS 21:27">di Manase kɔna-kakyɛ nwu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="JOS 21:27">Golan di Basan, (katanikokɔ okpoo diɛta ni otii wɔ nielo ni otii) ku Be Estara, di babɔkɛɛ lɛma sɛfa nweekɔ nsɔ nkyakaa nii- ekpoo ɛnyɔ;<verse eid="JOS 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 21:28" />di Isakar kɔna kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="JOS 21:28">Kision, Daberat, <verse eid="JOS 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 21:29" />Yarmut ku En Ganim, di babɔkɛɛ lɛma sɛfa nweekɔ nsɔ nkyakaa nii- ekpoo ɛna;<verse eid="JOS 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 21:30" />di Aser kɔna kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="JOS 21:30">Misal, Abdon, <verse eid="JOS 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 21:31" />Helkat ku Rehob, di babɔkɛɛ lɛma sɛfa nweekɔ nsɔ nkyakaa nii- ekpoo ɛna. <verse eid="JOS 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 21:32" />Di Naftali kɔna kamɛ</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="JOS 21:32">Kedes di Galilea (katanikokɔ okpoo diɛta ni otii wɔ nielo ni otii), Hamot Dor ku Kartan di babɔkɛɛ lɛma sɛfa nweekɔ nsɔ nkyakaa nii-ekpoo etiɛ.<verse eid="JOS 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 21:33" />Gerson batii sekpoo nfaabi mmuu labla lefosi-etiɛ, di babɔkɛɛ lɛma sɛfa nweekɔ nsɔ nkyakaa nii.<verse eid="JOS 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 21:34" />Merari batii nfaabi (Lewi batii bule nwu) baata ma:</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="JOS 21:34">di Sebulon kɔna kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="JOS 21:34">Yokneam ku Karta, <verse eid="JOS 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 21:35" />Dimna ku Nahalal, di babɔkɛɛ lɛma sɛfa nweekɔ nsɔ nkyakaa nii- ekpoo ɛna;<verse eid="JOS 21:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 21:36" />di Ruben kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="JOS 21:36">Beser, Yahas, <verse eid="JOS 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 21:37" />Kedemot ku Mefaat, di babɔkɛɛ lɛma sɛfa nweekɔ nsɔ nkyakaa nii- ekpoo ɛna;<verse eid="JOS 21:37" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 21:38" />di Gad kɔna kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="JOS 21:38">Ramot di Gilead (katanikokɔ okpoo diɛta ni otii wɔ nielo ni otii), Mahanaim, <verse eid="JOS 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 21:39" />Hesbon ku Yaser, di babɔkɛɛ lɛma sɛfa nweekɔ nsɔ nkyakaa nii- emuu labla ekpoo ɛna.<verse eid="JOS 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 21:40" />Sekpoo se simuu baata ni Merari batii nfaabi, mba niale ni Lewi batii bule labla lefosi-ɛnyɔ.<verse eid="JOS 21:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 21:41" />Lewi batii sekpoo di Israel batii kasɔ suoto simuu labla afosi-ana-ɛnɛ, di babɔkɛɛ lɛma sɛfa nweekɔ nsɔ nkyakaa nii. <verse eid="JOS 21:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 21:42" />Ekpoo be mmle obiala lawɛ babɔkɛɛ sɛfa nweekɔ nsɔ be niɛmana sĩ siakyi nii; nwaako diale diata sekpoo se mmle simuu.<verse eid="JOS 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 21:43" />Nioso SAATE nwu lata Israel omuu kasɔ ka aaka ntam aata ni bawa lɛma, ninfɛ baayɔ ka, baasiɛ ninfa nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 21:44" />SAATE nwu lata ma atoko ɔkyɛ ole di ɔfankyi biala, fɛ mmle aaka ntam aata ni bawa lɛma. Balo lɛma kuonwii ditafuo ma oyilako; SAATE nwu layɔ balo lɛma bamuu aakpee ma ninnɛɛ. <verse eid="JOS 21:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 21:45" />SAATE nwu ntam biene be mmuu aaka aata ni Israel leyo, kunwii ditasĩ kutawa ni kaanya; obiala lawa kaanya.<verse eid="JOS 21:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOS 22" />
  <para style="s1">Yosua Lata Kufĩ-Katunkɔ Kɔna Nwu Lasifi Sekpoo Lɛma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 22:1" />Ninfɛ di Yosua lalɛɛ Ruben batii, Gad batii ku Manase kɔna-kakyɛ nwu <verse eid="JOS 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 22:2" />ni aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Bitɔɔbla asaa ya amuu di SAATE nwu kpɛmblatɛ Mose latɔkɔ ye nii, bitɔɔkyɔɔ mi atoko kafɔɔ di lɛsaa biala latɔkɔ ye nii. <verse eid="JOS 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 22:3" />Obe kpinwu nfɛ nɛ- diɛbadu ni miɛ dii le mmle- biisĩ babilee-suɔtɔbi, kafɔɔ bitɔɔbla ɔsaabla wɔ di SAATE, Yaa lee nwu lata ye nii. <verse eid="JOS 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 22:4" />Kanunua ka mmle di SAATE, Yaa lee ntɔɔta ni babilee-suɔtɔbi ɔnyɛɛ ɔtɛ fɛ mmle aaka ni ntam yi, bikple bisifi sekpoo lee di kasɔ ka di SAATE nwu kpɛmblatɛ Mose lata ye ni di Yordan okle kamaa. <verse eid="JOS 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 22:5" />Kafɔɔ bilolaa binyu nwaa bilɛ biemufũ sɛsaabla ku kufiofa nwu di SAATE nwu kpɛmblatɛ Mose lata ye ni biklee: alɛ biabɔmbɔ SAATE, Yaa lee nwu, minkyɛ di sisuku nɔɔ simuu, minkyɔɔ afiofa nɔɔ atoko, mimmufũ nwɔ minklee kpinkpĩ, minsumu nwɔ kafɔɔ ku otu lee omuu ku ɔkla lee omuu.”<verse eid="JOS 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 22:6" />Ninfɛ di Yosua lata ma lɛtɔtrɔ aadiki ma osuku, ni baasifi sekpoo lɛma nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 22:7" />(Mose lata Manase kɔna-kakyɛ nwu kasɔ di Basan, kakyɛ nyɔɔfa nwu kafɔɔ, Yosua lata ma kasɔ ku babilɛma-suɔtɔbi di Yordan kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ lɛkyɛ.) Obe wɔ di Yosua ladiki ma ni osuku baasifi ni sekpoo lɛma yi, aata ma lɛtɔtrɔ, <verse eid="JOS 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 22:8" />aabuɛ alɛ, “Bikple bisifi sekpoo lee ku lɛsaawɛ kplɛ lee- ku babɔkɛɛ sele sɛlambu kplɛ, ku koto fututu, koto sɛɛle, kɔbri ku abɔɔsaa ku abula kpinwu- biɛsɛ kafɔɔ kakpɛ kamɛ asaa ya biɛwɛ biekyeko ni balo lee nfũ minko babilee-suɔtɔbi.” <verse eid="JOS 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 22:9" />Nioso Ruben batii, Gad batii ku Manase kɔna-kakyɛ nwu ladiɛ Israel batii di Silo di Kanaan, baakple baasifi Gilead, di kasɔ lɛma kamu suoto, nka baafũ ni, di SAATE nwu ladiki ni kanya aafenko ni di Mose suoto.<verse eid="JOS 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 22:10" />Obe wɔ baabadu ni Gelilot ninkaako ni Yordan di Kanaan kasɔ suoto yi, Ruben batii, Gad batii ku Manase kɔna-kakyɛ nwu lapɛ oleɔta akyikye ya niatɛ aamuɔ ni ninfa di Yordan Okle ɔlɔɔkɔ. <verse eid="JOS 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 22:11" />Ni di obe wɔ di Israel batii lanu alɛ batɔɔpɛ ni oleɔta akyikye di Kanaan kɔmɛ di Gelilot, dikaako ni Yordan di Israel batii lɛkyɛ yi, <verse eid="JOS 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 22:12" />Israel batii dikudi nimuu lasi di Silo alɛ bɔɔlaakpɛko ma.<verse eid="JOS 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 22:13" />Nioso Israel batii lakpee oletatɛ Eleasar obisuɔtɔbi Finehas alɛ akyɛ Ruben, Gad ku Manase kɔna-kakyɛ nwu nfũ- di Gilead kasɔ suoto. <verse eid="JOS 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 22:14" />Baakpee ɔka basuɔtɔ lefosi ku nnwɔɔ, osuɔtɔ onwii, onwii di Israel kɔna biala kamɛ, leyo kamɛ biala ɔnɔɔfo di Israel batii nfaabi kamɛ.<verse eid="JOS 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 22:15" />Obe wɔ baakyɛ ni Ruben, Gad ku Manase kɔna-kakyɛ nwu nfũ- di Gilead yi- baatɔkɔ ma alɛ: <verse eid="JOS 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 22:16" />“SAATE nwu dikudi nimuu kobuɛ alɛ: ‘Lɛ oso biɛlalaasa ofũ onu ku Israel Yaa nwu nkpo? Lɛ oso nfɛ biedie di SAATE nwu kamaa, biɛlaapɛ oleɔta akyikye biɛta suoto lee, biɛtaka biyɛ nwɔ di suoto nunua? <verse eid="JOS 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 22:17" />Ni Peor okpile nwu diipɔ wo? Diɛbase bia miɛ dii le mmle buukleklesa suoto loo di okpile nwu suoto, nu bia di ɔfiɛ kpile lapɛ SAATE nwu batii! <verse eid="JOS 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 22:18" />Nunua nfɛ biokple di SAATE nwu kamaa?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 22:18">“‘Nse biɛtaka bieyila di SAATE nwu suoto miɛ, kɔsɛɛ abanya ɔblɔ ankpeeko Israel batii bamuu. <verse eid="JOS 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 22:19" />Nse kasɔ ka biefũ ni ntɔɔlalaa yi, bisifi biwa SAATE nwu kasɔ suoto, lɛba le di SAATE nwu lɛkpaayo klekle n-yɛ ni, biɛbasɛ kasɔ nwu ku awo. Kafɔɔ bitantaka biayila di SAATE nwu suoto ee suoto loo alɛ biapɛ oleɔta akyikye minta suoto lee, ninlenkee SAATE, Yaa loo oleɔta akyikye nwu sɛmaa. <verse eid="JOS 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 22:20" />Obe wɔ di Serah obisuɔtɔbi Akan ditale ni onukwale di asaa ya bɛɛyɔ bɛɛta ni SAATE nwu suoto, diele letoko nanfi niawa di Israel batii bamuu suoto? Ditale lete nɔɔ niakpi ta okpile nɔɔ oso.’”<verse eid="JOS 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 22:21" />Ninfɛ di Ruben, Gad ku Manase kɔna-kakyɛ nwu latɔkɔ Israel nfaabi nwu banɔɔfo alɛ: <verse eid="JOS 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 22:22" />“Sientɛ Nwu, Yaa, SAATE nwu! Sientɛ Nwu, Yaa, SAATE nwu! Aye! Bita Israel atofo! Nse nle mmle ninle ɔtaka oyila di suoto ee otokopĩ ɔwɛ di SAATE nwu suoto, ni tanta wo buasiɛ nkpa miɛ dii le mmle. <verse eid="JOS 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 22:23" />Nse ɔpɛ buɔpɛ oleɔta akyikye loo amu bulɛ buokple nkpaamaa di SAATE nwu suoto, munta ɔfiɛ asaaɔta ku alesaa asaaɔta ee atoko ɔkyɛ ole oleɔta asaaɔta di nnya suoto yi, ni SAATE nwu omu akaalɛ wo ɔlaa.<verse eid="JOS 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 22:24" />“Oowo! Buabla ni di lɛyɛkɛ kamɛ bulɛ dii lewo banantii lee katɔkɔ bale wo alɛ, ‘Obe biɔblako SAATE, Israel Yaa nwu? <verse eid="JOS 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 22:25" />SAATE nwu ntɔɔyɔ Yordan eetika kɔmɛ di awo ku aye ntɛɛ- aye Ruben batii ku Gad batii! Binaa kalekɔ kukanwii di SAATE nwu kamɛ.’ Nioso banantii lee kata bale wo ndiɛ SAATE nwu ɔyɛkɛ.<verse eid="JOS 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 22:26" />“Nkpo oso buabuɛ bulɛ, ‘Bita bulolaa suoto buɔpɛ oleɔta akyikye- kafɔɔ diele ofiɛ asaaɔta ee oleɔta oso.’ <verse eid="JOS 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 22:27" />Kafɔɔ, dibale kamaadiyilasaa di awo ku aye ku ana ya nikɔwa ni ntɛɛ, alɛ buasumu SAATE nwu di lɛkpaayo klekle nɔɔ ku ofiɛ asaaɔta ku seleɔta ku atoko ɔkyɛ ole asaaɔta loo. Ni dii kaamaa, banantii lee dilɔbafuo bale wo ɔtɔkɔ alɛ, ‘Binaa kalekɔ kukanwii di SAATE nwu kamɛ.’<verse eid="JOS 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 22:28" />“Ni buabuɛ bulɛ, ‘Nse bɛɛnwaanii beebuɛ nnwɔ mmle bɛɛtɔkɔ wo ee banantii loo yi, bubatɔkɔ ma bulɛ: Binyu SAATE nwu oleɔta akyikye nwu okle, di bate loo lapɛ ni, diele alɛ baata ni ofiɛ asaaɔta ku oleɔta oso, kafɔɔ kamaadiyilasaa di awo ku aye ntɛɛ.’<verse eid="JOS 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 22:29" />“Dikyɛ diokyo di suoto loo alɛ buayila di SAATE nwu suoto, munkple nkpaamaa di suoto nɔɔ miɛ alɛ buapɛ oleɔta akyikye munta ɔfiɛ asaaɔta ku alesaa asaaɔta ku oleɔta, ninlenkee SAATE, Yaa loo oleɔta akyikye nwu sɛmaa, n-ya nin-yɛ ni di lɛkpaayo klekle nɔɔ anu.”<verse eid="JOS 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 22:30" />Obe wɔ di oletatɛ Finehas ku okpoo batunletɛ- Israel batii nfaabi banɔɔfo-lanu ni ɔlaa wɔ di Ruben, Gad ku Manase labuɛ nii, suoto layɔɔ ma. <verse eid="JOS 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 22:31" />Ni di oletatɛ Eleasar obisuɔtɔbi Finehas latɔkɔ Ruben, Gad ku Manase alɛ, “Miɛ buotofo bulɛ SAATE nwu nsiko wo, diekye biediki kɔkpaa kpile di SAATE nwu suoto di ɔlaa wɔ mmle suoto. Kanunua bitoodiki Israel batii di SAATE nwu nnɛɛ.”<verse eid="JOS 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 22:32" />Ninfɛ di oletatɛ Eleasar obisuɔtɔbi Finehas ku batunletɛ nwu lakple baasifi Kanaan di nfũ baakpee ni asi baawo ku Ruben batii ku Gad batii di Gilead kasɔ suoto ni baalaatɔkɔ Israel batii nle baanya ni nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 22:33" />Baanu ni ɔlaa nwu suoto layɔɔ ma, ni baatansa Yaa nɛ. Nioso batasintɔkɔ alɛ bɔɔlaadieko ma kakpɛ munwɔɔsa kale ka di Ruben batii ku Gad batii nsi nii.<verse eid="JOS 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 22:34" />Ninfɛ di Ruben batii ku Gad batii lata oleɔta akyikye nwu leyooto le mmle alɛ: Kamaayilatɛ di Awo Ntɛɛ alɛ SAATE nwu ninle Yaa.<verse eid="JOS 22:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOS 23" />
  <para style="s1">Yosua Lɛklaa Lɛkakatɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 23:1" />Di obe kpinwu sɛmaa, di SAATE nwu ntɔɔta ni Israel ɔnyɛɛ ɔtɛ di balo lɛma bamuu niɛmana ma beekyi ni suoto, di obe nwu Yosua ntoobe, ɛɛkpa ni anu nwaa di alɛɛ kamɛ yi, <verse eid="JOS 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 23:2" />aalɛɛ Israel omuu- banɔɔfo, batunletɛ, bakantɛ ku banɔɔfotii lɛma-ni aatɔkɔ ma alɛ: “Ntoobe, lɛkpa anu nwaa kafɔɔ di alɛɛ kamɛ. <verse eid="JOS 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 23:3" />Aye bamu bitɔɔnya lɛsaa biala di SAATE, Yaa lee ntɔɔbla ni nnle be mmle mmuu ta aye oso; SAATE, Yaa lee ninle nnwɔ niakpɛ aata ye nii. <verse eid="JOS 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 23:4" />Binyuma mmle lasɛ ni nnle be niabu ni mmuu kasɔ fɛ atesaa lata ni ana lee- nnle be lalenkee nii- di Yordan ku Lekpo Kplɛ di kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ obo. <verse eid="JOS 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 23:5" />SAATE, Yaa lee omu kamatososa ma andiki di osuku lee. Abatukusa ma andiki di anu lee, minaayɔ kasɔ lɛma nwu, fɛ mmle di SAATE, Yaa lee labuɛ aatɛ aata ye nii.<verse eid="JOS 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 23:6" />“Biwɛ osie nwaa; bilolaa binyu biɛkyɔɔ atoko di asaa ya amuu bɛɛkpana ni di Mose Kufiofa Kukũ nwu kamɛ, alɛ biemunikĩi bife oletanɛɛkyɛ ee ɔmɛntukyɛ. <verse eid="JOS 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 23:7" />Bitambla onwii ku nnle be niebu basi ni kaamɛ lee; bitanlɛɛ afiɔ lɛma ayooto ee bika ntam di asaa lɛma suoto. Bitansumu nya ee biawakasɔ biata nya. <verse eid="JOS 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 23:8" />Kafɔɔ dikpeni biemufũ SAATE Yaa lee bieklee kpinkpĩ, fɛ mmle bikle ni bia nua.<verse eid="JOS 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 23:9" />“SAATE nwu ntootososa nnle kplɛ ku nsiene di anu lee; diɛbadu miɛ dii le mmle, kuonwii diifuo ye oyilako. <verse eid="JOS 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 23:10" />Onwii lee lalenkee batii kakpe, diekye SAATE Yaa lee nkpɛ anta ye, fɛ mmle aabuɛ aatɛ nii. <verse eid="JOS 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 23:11" />Nioso bilolaa binyu nwaa, biɛbɔmbɔ SAATE Yaa lee.<verse eid="JOS 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 23:12" />“Kafɔɔ nse biemunikĩi biɛlaakpɔtɔsa suoto lee ku mba ninkpe ni nkpa di nnle be niebu basi ni di kamɛ lee, nse biɔyɔ bawo ku mma, biɛbla onwii ku ma kafɔɔ yi, <verse eid="JOS 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 23:13" />ni bitofo nwaa bilɛ SAATE Yaa lee nwu dilɔbasintososa nnle nwu di anu lee. Nni kamaa, nfɛ babakple akyĩ ku sikũ manta ye, kowesee di mmaa lee ku siwuu di anumbi lee, ninaase di obe wɔ bibakpi mindie ni di kasɔ biene ka mmle, di SAATE, Yaa lee lɛta ye nii.<verse eid="JOS 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 23:14" />“Kanunua nfɛ komamiɛ nlɛ nkyɛ bawa loo osuku nwu. Biye di situ lee ku sɛkla lee simuu bilɛ ntam biene nwu mmuu di SAATE Yaa lee lata ye ni kunwii diesĩ alɛ diɛwa kaanya. Ntam biala ntɔɔwa kaanya; kunwii diesĩ ku ɔwa. <verse eid="JOS 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 23:15" />Kafɔɔ fɛ mmle di SAATE Yaa lee ntam biene biala lɛwa ni kaanya, nkpo di SAATE nwu kamawako okpile omuu aafunaa nii, ninaase di obe wɔ atɔɔwɔɔsa ye ni di kasɔ biene ka ɛɛta ye ni suoto nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 23:16" />Nse biɛwaalɛ SAATE Yaa lee kanya ninii, nka ɛɛta ye nii, biɛkyɛ biosumu bayaa bamba, minwakasɔ minta nya kafɔɔ, ni SAATE nwu ɔblɔ kamasoo di suoto lee, ni bibakpi wla mindie di kasɔ biene ka ɛɛta ye ni suoto.”<verse eid="JOS 23:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOS 24" />
  <para style="s1">Yosua Lakakatɛ Aata Batii Nwu Di Sekem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 24:1" />Ninfɛ di Yosua lasiisa Israel ana nwu amuu di Sekem nɛ. Aalɛɛ banɔɔfo, batunletɛ, bakantɛ ku Israel banɔɔfotii, ni baawa di Yaa anu nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 24:2" />Ni di Yosua latɔkɔ batii nwu bamuu alɛ, “Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Israel Yaa nwu kobuɛ ni: ‘Saa yi, bawa lee, di Abraham ku Nahor ote Tera nkyakaa nii, lasiɛ di Okle<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okle nwu ninle Efrat nɛ</char></note> kamaa baasumu bayaa bamba kafɔɔ. <verse eid="JOS 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 24:3" />Kafɔɔ lakpaa teeye Abraham ladieko di kasɔ nwu di Okle kamaa, laleko nwɔ katũ lafenko di Kanaan, ni latɔɔ banantii kpinwu nɛ. Latɔɔ Isak, <verse eid="JOS 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 24:4" />Isak kafɔɔ latɔɔ Yakob ku Esau. Layɔ Seir lekpenkpe kale nwu lata Esau, kafɔɔ Yakob ku babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ lasifi Egipte.<verse eid="JOS 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 24:5" />“‘Ninfɛ lakpee Mose ku Aron, ni lata nimiina lawa di Egipte batii suoto di nle labla ni ninfa, ni lakpaa ye ladieko nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 24:6" />Lakpaa bate lee ladieko ni di Egipte, baawa lekpo nwu katũ, ni di Egipte batii latikanko ma ku bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnaanfi ni ku bapɔnkɔ basiɛtɛ babadu bia Lekpo Sɛɛle. <verse eid="JOS 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 24:7" />Kafɔɔ baalɛɛ SAATE nwu alɛ akyakaako ma, ni aakpee ditunu di aye ku Egipte batii ntɛɛ nɛ; aakpaa lekpo nwu aakpete ma di suoto diatĩi ma. Bianya lɛsaa le labla ni Egipte batii ku anu lee amu. Ninfɛ biasiɛ di ɔfaafuu kamɛ obe kpinwu nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 24:8" />“‘Ni Lakpaa ye lawako Amori batii ba niasiɛ ni di Yordan kufĩ-katunkɔ kasɔ suoto nɛ. Baakpɛko ye, kafɔɔ layɔ ma lakpee di nnɛɛ lee. Lawɔɔsa ma di anu lee, ni biayɔ kasɔ lɛma nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 24:9" />Obe wɔ di Moab ɔka Sipor obisuɔtɔbi Balak, lalolaa suoto alɛ ɔɔbakpɛko ni Israel, aakpee Beor obisuɔtɔbi Bileam alɛ akpaani ye. <verse eid="JOS 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 24:10" />Kafɔɔ namanu Bileam ɔlaa, nioso aata ye lɛtɔtrɔ aakyakaa, aakple aakyakaa ni, ni ladiki ye di nnɛɛ nɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 24:11" />“‘Ninfɛ biawaalɛ Yordan ni biawa Yeriko nɛ. Yeriko batii lakpɛko ye, fɛ mmle kafɔɔ di Amori batii, Perisi batii, Kanaan batii, Heti batii, Girgasi batii, Hewi batii ku Yebusi batii labla ye nii. Kafɔɔ layɔ ma lakpee di nnɛɛ lee. <verse eid="JOS 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 24:12" />Lakyesee batɔntɔ lalesa ye katũ baabatososa ma baadiki, ni di anu lee-ku Amori batii baka nwu banyɔ kafɔɔ. Bitabla nle mmle ku aye bamu kapamii ee kɔtaa. <verse eid="JOS 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 24:13" />Nioso lata ye kasɔ ka suoto ditabuo ye nii, ku sekpoo se bitabudi nii; ni biasiɛ sĩ kaamɛ biale di nta awosobi afe ku nnɔnyi awosobi ya bita pɛ ni nɛ.’<verse eid="JOS 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 24:14" />“Nunua biyɛkɛ SAATE nwu, biesumu nwɔ ku onukwale omuu. Bifuki bayaa ba di bawa lee lasumu ni di Okle kamaa ku Egipte biyu, biesumu SAATE nwu. <verse eid="JOS 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 24:15" />Kafɔɔ nse SAATE nwu osumu kamakpɛ ye nkyɔkɔ yi, ni miɛ dii le mmle bidiki nnwɔ bibasumu ni bita suoto lee, nse bayaa ba di bawa lee lasumu ni di Okle kamaa, ee Amori batii ba kasɔ bisi ni afiɔ. Kafɔɔ ami ku leyo nii batii, bubasumu SAATE nwu.”<verse eid="JOS 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 24:16" />Ninfɛ di batii nwu ladiki kanya alɛ, “Dikyɛ diokyo di suoto loo, alɛ buasĩ SAATE nwu, munaasumu bayaa bamba! <verse eid="JOS 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 24:17" />SAATE Yaa loo nwu omu niakpaa wo ku bate loo aadieko di Egipte, di sɛlanle kasɔ, ni aabla atuosaa kplɛ nwu di anu loo nɛ. Aatĩtĩi wo di osuku loo omuu ɔkyɛ ku nnle be mmuu kamɛ buakyɛ buafe nii. <verse eid="JOS 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 24:18" />Ni di SAATE nwu latososa nnle nwu mmuu di anu loo, di Amori batii ba niasiɛ ni di kasɔ nwu suoto nkyakaa nii. Awo kafɔɔ bubasumu SAATE nwu, diekye Yaa loo ale.”<verse eid="JOS 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 24:19" />Kafɔɔ Yosua latɔkɔ batii nwu alɛ, “Bilɔbafuo SAATE nwu osumu. Yaa klekle ale; Yaa wɔ ninkpɛ ni sɛsɔfɔwo ale. Ɔlɔbayɔ otokopĩ lee ku sikpile lee akyɛ ye. <verse eid="JOS 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 24:20" />Nse biesĩ SAATE nwu, biɛlaasumu bafɔɔ bayaa yi, abamunikĩi an-yɔ nimiina anwako ye, anta kunloo ye, di dibiene le atɔɔbla ɛɛta ye ni sɛmaa.”<verse eid="JOS 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 24:21" />Kafɔɔ batii nwu latɔkɔ Yosua alɛ, “Oowo! Bubasumu SAATE nwu.”<verse eid="JOS 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 24:22" />Ninfɛ di Yosua labuɛ alɛ, “Aye bamu ninle kamaabayilatɛ di suoto lee, bilɛ bietuna bilɛ bibasumu SAATE nwu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 24:22">Ni baatuna alɛ, “Yii, kamaabayilatɛ bule.”<verse eid="JOS 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 24:23" />Ni di Yosua labuɛ alɛ, “Ni nunua, bifuki bafɔɔ bayaa nwu kaamɛ lee biyu, biɛyɔ situ lee bita SAATE Israel Yaa nwu.”<verse eid="JOS 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 24:24" />Ninfɛ di batii nwu latɔkɔ Yosua alɛ, "Bubasumu SAATE Yaa loo, munkyɔɔ nwɔ atoko kafɔɔ.”<verse eid="JOS 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 24:25" />Di dii nwu nkpo Yosua labla kanya ninii aata batii nwu, ni aatɛ sɛsaabla ku afiofa nsũ aata ma di Sekem ninfa nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 24:26" />Ni di Yosua lakpana asaa ya mmle di Yaa Kufiofa Kukũ kamɛ nɛ. Ninfɛ aayɔ difuɔ kplɛ ninwii aase ninfa di kowoso kplɛ nwu kalɔ di SAATE nwu kakleklekɔ nwu ɔlɔɔkɔ nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 24:27" />Ninfɛ di Yosua latɔkɔ batii nwu bamuu alɛ, "Binyu! Difuɔ le mmle kamale kamaayilatɛ di suoto loo. Ditoonu sɛlaa se simuu di SAATE nwu ntoobuɛ ɛɛtɔkɔ wo nii. Dibale kamaayilatɛ di suoto lee nse biele onukwale bita Yaa lee.”<verse eid="JOS 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 24:28" />Ninfɛ di Yosua lata batii nwu lasifi, obiala ku atesaa nɔɔ amu nfũ nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yosua Ku Eleasar Lakpi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 24:29" />Di asaa ya mmle sɛmaa, Nun obisuɔtɔbi Yosua, SAATE nwu kpɛmblatɛ lakpi, aafũ kɔlafa alɛɛ lefosi. <verse eid="JOS 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 24:30" />Ni baakookaa nwɔ di atesaa nɔɔ kasɔ, di Timnat Sera di Efraim kale lekpenkpe, di Gaas Kobokote katoo-kasɔ nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 24:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 24:31" />Israel lasumu Saate nwu di Yosua nkpa osiɛbee omuu kamɛ ku banɔɔfo ba niabu baasiɛ ni nkpa baalenkee nwɔ nii, baanya ni kafɔɔ lɛsaa biala le di Saate nwu labla aata ni Israel.<verse eid="JOS 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 24:32" />Ni baakookaa Yosef akufi ya di Israel batii layɔ baakyeko ni Egipte di Sekem kasɔ nɛ. Di lɛba le di Yakob laya ni ku koto fututu kɔlafa aakyeko ni Sekem ote Hamor babisuɔtɔbi nfũ. Kasɔ ka mmle labakple Yosef banantii atesaa.<verse eid="JOS 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 24:33" />Ninfɛ di Aron obisuɔtɔbi Eleasar lakpi baakookaa nwɔ di Gibea, kasɔ ka baata ni obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Finehas di Efraim kale lekpenkpe nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 24:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 24" />
</usx>